msgstr "Film NTSC (IVTC)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:371
msgid "Disable screensaver"
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕົວຖະໜອມໜ້າຈໍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:372
msgid "Disable the screensaver during video playback."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕົວຖະໜອມໜ້າຈໍໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳນົດຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:374
msgid "Inhibit the power management daemon during playback"
msgstr "ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລະບົບຈັດການພະລັງງານໃນຂະນະທີ່ຫຼິ້ນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:375
msgid ""
"Inhibits the power management daemon during any playback, to avoid the "
"computer being suspended because of inactivity."
msgstr "ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລະບົບຈັດການພະລັງງານໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນມີເດຍ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຄອມພິວເຕີເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດພັກເຄື່ອງ (suspended) ເພາະບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:378 modules/gui/macosx/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:351
#: modules/gui/qt/ui/sprefs_video.h:317
msgid "Window decorations"
msgstr "ການຕົກແຕ່ງໜ້າຕ່າງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:380
msgid ""
"VLC can avoid creating window caption, frames, etc... around the video, "
"giving a \"minimal\" window."
msgstr "VLC ສາມາດປິດການສ້າງຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງ, ຂອບ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ ອ້ອມຮອບວິດີໂອ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເປັນໜ້າຕ່າງແບບ \"ລຽບງ່າຍ\" ທີ່ສຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:383
msgid "Video splitter module"
msgstr "ໂໂມດູນຕົວແຍກວິດີໂອ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:385
msgid "This adds video splitters like clone or wall"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວແຍກວິດີໂອ ເຊັ່ນ ການເຮັດຊ້ຳ (clone) ຫຼື ແບບຝາ (wall)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:387
msgid "Video filter module"
msgstr "ໂໂມດູນຕົວຕອງວິດີໂອ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:389
msgid ""
"This adds post-processing filters to enhance the picture quality, for "
"instance deinterlacing, or distort the video."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງປະມວນຜົນພາຍຫຼັງເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບຂອງຮູບພາບ ເຊັ່ນ ການລົບເສັ້ນຂວາງ ຫຼື ການບິດເບືອນວິດີໂອ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:393
msgid "Video snapshot directory (or filename)"
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເກັບຮູບຖ່າຍວິດີໂອ (ຫຼື ຊື່ໄຟລ໌)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:395
msgid "Directory where the video snapshots will be stored."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເກັບຮູບຖ່າຍຈາກວິດີໂອ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:397 src/libvlc-module.c:399
msgid "Video snapshot file prefix"
msgstr "ຄຳນຳໜ້າຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຮູບຖ່າຍວິດີໂອ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:401
msgid "Video snapshot format"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຮູບຖ່າຍວິດີໂອ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:403
msgid "Image format which will be used to store the video snapshots"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ບັນທຶກຮູບຖ່າຍຈາກວິດີໂອ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:405
msgid "Display video snapshot preview"
msgstr "ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຮູບຖ່າຍວິດີໂອ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:407
msgid "Display the snapshot preview in the screen's top-left corner."
msgstr "ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຮູບທີ່ຖ່າຍໄດ້ຢູ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:409
msgid "Use sequential numbers instead of timestamps"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເລກລຳດັບແທນການໃຊ້ເວລາ (timestamps)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:411
msgid "Use sequential numbers instead of timestamps for snapshot numbering"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການລຽງລຳດັບຕົວເລກແທນການໃຊ້ວັນເວລາສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຊື່ຮູບຖ່າຍ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:413
msgid "Video snapshot width"
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຮູບຖ່າຍວິດີໂອ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:415
msgid ""
"You can enforce the width of the video snapshot. By default it will keep the "
"original width (-1). Using 0 will scale the width to keep the aspect ratio."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຮູບຖ່າຍວິດີໂອໄດ້. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (-1) ຈະຮັກສາຄວາມກວ້າງຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ການໃຊ້ 0 ຈະປັບຄວາມກວ້າງເພື່ອຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:419
msgid "Video snapshot height"
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງຂອງຮູບຖ່າຍວິດີໂອ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:421
msgid ""
"You can enforce the height of the video snapshot. By default it will keep "
"the original height (-1). Using 0 will scale the height to keep the aspect "
"ratio."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຄວາມສູງຂອງຮູບຖ່າຍວິດີໂອໄດ້. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (-1) ຈະຮັກສາຄວາມສູງຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ການໃຊ້ 0 ຈະປັບຄວາມສູງເພື່ອຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:425
msgid "Video cropping"
msgstr "ການຄອບຕັດວິດີໂອ (Video cropping)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:427
msgid ""
"This forces the cropping of the source video. Accepted formats are x:y (4:3, "
"16:9, etc.) expressing the global image aspect."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບການຄອບຕັດວິດີໂອຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ຮູບແບບທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄື x:y (4:3, 16:9, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:431
msgid "Source aspect ratio"
msgstr "ອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:433
msgid ""
"This forces the source aspect ratio. For instance, some DVDs claim to be "
"16:9 while they are actually 4:3. This can also be used as a hint for VLC "
"when a movie does not have aspect ratio information. Accepted formats are "
"x:y (4:3, 16:9, etc.) expressing the global image aspect, or a float value "
"(1.25, 1.3333, etc.) expressing pixel squareness."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ເຊັ່ນ DVD ບາງແຜ່ນລະບຸວ່າເປັນ 16:9 ແຕ່ຕົວຈິງເປັນ 4:3. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອບອກ VLC ເມື່ອໜັງບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ. ຮູບແບບທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄື x:y (4:3, 16:9) ຫຼື ຄ່າຕົວເລກ (1.25, 1.3333)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:440
msgid "Video Auto Scaling"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດວິດີໂອອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:442
msgid "Let the video scale to fit a given window or fullscreen."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ວິດີໂອປັບຂະໜາດໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື ແບບເຕັມຈໍ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:444
msgid "Video scaling factor"
msgstr "ອັດຕາການປັບຂະໜາດວິດີໂອ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:446
msgid ""
"Scaling factor used when Auto Scaling is disabled.\n"
"Default value is 1.0 (original video size)."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອປິດການປັບຂະໜາດອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1.0 (ຂະໜາດວິດີໂອຕົ້ນສະບັບ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:449
msgid "Custom crop ratios list"
msgstr "ລາຍການອັດຕາສ່ວນການຄອບຕັດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:451
msgid ""
"Comma separated list of crop ratios which will be added in the interface's "
"crop ratios list."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ອັດຕາສ່ວນການຄອບຕັດທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍໝາຍຈຸດ (,) ເພື່ອເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການຂອງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:454
msgid "Custom aspect ratios list"
msgstr "ລາຍການອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:456
msgid ""
"Comma separated list of aspect ratios which will be added in the interface's "
"aspect ratio list."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍໝາຍຈຸດ (,) ເພື່ອເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການຂອງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:459
msgid "Fix HDTV height"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂຄວາມສູງ HDTV"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:461
msgid ""
"This allows proper handling of HDTV-1080 video format even if broken encoder "
"incorrectly sets height to 1088 lines. You should only disable this option "
"if your video has a non-standard format requiring all 1088 lines."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຈັດການຮູບແບບ HDTV-1080 ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຕົວເຂົ້າລະຫັດຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສູງຜິດເປັນ 1088 ເສັ້ນກໍ່ຕາມ. ເຈົ້າຄວນປິດຕົວເລືອກນີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອວິດີໂອຂອງເຈົ້າເປັນຮູບແບບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ທັງໝົດ 1088 ເສັ້ນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:466
msgid "Monitor pixel aspect ratio"
msgstr "ອັດຕາສ່ວນພິກເຊວຂອງຈໍພາບ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:468
msgid ""
"This forces the monitor aspect ratio. Most monitors have square pixels "
"(1:1). If you have a 16:9 screen, you might need to change this to 4:3 in "
"order to keep proportions."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບຂອງຈໍພາບ. ຈໍພາບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມີພິກເຊວເປັນຮູບສີ່ລ່ຽມຈະຕຸລັດ (1:1). ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີຈໍ 16:9, ເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງປ່ຽນເປັນ 4:3 ເພື່ອຮັກສາສັດສ່ວນໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:472 modules/gui/macosx/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:294
msgid "Skip frames"
msgstr "ຂ້າມເຟຣມ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:474
msgid ""
"Enables framedropping on MPEG2 stream. Framedropping occurs when your "
"computer is not powerful enough"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຂ້າມເຟຣມໃນສະຕຣີມ MPEG2. ການຂ້າມເຟຣມຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງເຈົ້າມີກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນບໍ່ພຽງພໍ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:477
msgid "Drop late frames"
msgstr "ຖິ້ມເຟຣມທີ່ຊ້າ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:479
msgid ""
"This drops frames that are late (arrive to the video output after their "
"intended display date)."
msgstr "ຖິ້ມເຟຣມທີ່ສົ່ງມາກາຍເວລາ (ມາຮອດເອົາພຸດວິດີໂອຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດການສະແດງຜົນ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:482
msgid "Quiet synchro"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແບບງຽບ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:484
msgid ""
"This avoids flooding the message log with debug output from the video output "
"synchronization mechanism."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (debug) ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປຈາກກົນໄກການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເອົາພຸດວິດີໂອໃນລັອກ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:487
msgid "Key press events"
msgstr "ເຫດການການບີບປຸ່ມຄີບອດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:489
msgid "This enables VLC hotkeys from the (non-embedded) video window."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດຂອງ VLC ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງວິດີໂອ (ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຝັງໄວ້)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:491 modules/spu/remoteosd.c:91
msgid "Mouse events"
msgstr "ເຫດການການໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:493
msgid "This enables handling of mouse clicks on the video."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຈັດການເມື່ອມີການຄລິກເມົາສ໌ເທິງວິດີໂອ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:501
msgid ""
"These options allow you to modify the behavior of the input subsystem, such "
"as the DVD or VCD device, the network interface settings or the subtitle "
"channel."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປັບປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກຳຂອງລະບົບອິນພຸດ ເຊັ່ນ ອຸປະກອນ DVD ຫຼື VCD, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງຄຳບັນຍາຍ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:505
msgid "File caching (ms)"
msgstr "ການແຄຊໄຟລ໌ (ມິນລິວິນາທີ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:507
msgid "Caching value for local files, in milliseconds."
msgstr "ຄ່າການແຄຊສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ໃນເຄື່ອງ, ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:509
msgid "Live capture caching (ms)"
msgstr "ການແຄຊການບັນທຶກສົດ (ມິນລິວິນາທີ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:511
msgid "Caching value for cameras and microphones, in milliseconds."
msgstr "ຄ່າການແຄຊສຳລັບກ້ອງ ແລະ ໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ, ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:513
msgid "Disc caching (ms)"
msgstr "ການແຄຊແຜ່ນ (ມິນລິວິນາທີ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:515
msgid "Caching value for optical media, in milliseconds."
msgstr "ຄ່າການແຄຊສຳລັບແຜ່ນມີເດຍ, ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:517
msgid "Network caching (ms)"
msgstr "ການແຄຊເຄືອຂ່າຍ (ມິນລິວິນາທີ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:519
msgid "Caching value for network resources, in milliseconds."
msgstr "ຄ່າການແຄຊສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:521
msgid "Clock reference average counter"
msgstr "ຕົວນັບຄ່າສະເລ່ຍການອ້າງອີງເວລາ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:523
msgid ""
"When using the PVR input (or a very irregular source), you should set this "
"to 10000."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ PVR ອິນພຸດ (ຫຼື ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ຄົງທີ່), ເຈົ້າຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ 10000."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:526
msgid "Clock synchronisation"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເວລາ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:528
msgid ""
"It is possible to disable the input clock synchronisation for real-time "
"sources. Use this if you experience jerky playback of network streams."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເວລາອິນພຸດສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນແບບຮຽວໄທມ໌ (real-time) ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖ້າເຈົ້າພົບວ່າການຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມເຄືອຂ່າຍມີການກະຕຸກ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:532
msgid "Clock jitter"
msgstr "ຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນຂອງເວລາ (Clock jitter)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:534
msgid ""
"This defines the maximum input delay jitter that the synchronization "
"algorithms should try to compensate (in milliseconds)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນຂອງເວລາສູງສຸດທີ່ລະບົບຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄວນພະຍາຍາມຊົດເຊີຍ (ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:537
msgid "Network synchronisation"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:538
msgid ""
"This allows you to remotely synchronise clocks for server and client. The "
"detailed settings are available in Advanced / Network Sync."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຊິງໂຄຣໄນເວລາລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ຄລາຍແອນ (client) ໄດ້ຈາກໄລຍະໄກ. ເບິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະອຽດໄດ້ທີ່ ຂັ້ນສູງ / Network Sync."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:544 src/video_output/vout_intf.c:98
#: src/video_output/vout_intf.c:116 modules/access/dshow/dshow.cpp:92
#: modules/access/dshow/dshow.cpp:99 modules/access/dshow/dshow.cpp:119
#: modules/access/dshow/dshow.cpp:2079 modules/audio_output/alsa.c:767
#: modules/audio_output/directsound.c:1031 modules/codec/avcodec/avcodec.c:50
#: modules/demux/adaptive/adaptive.cpp:97
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCAudioEffectsWindowController.m:85
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:592
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:649
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCVideoEffectsWindowController.m:51
#: modules/gui/macosx/prefs_widgets.m:1217
#: modules/gui/macosx/prefs_widgets.m:1274
#: modules/gui/qt/components/preferences_widgets.cpp:546
#: modules/logger/file.c:203 modules/spu/marq.c:61 modules/spu/rss.c:69
#: modules/spu/rss.c:182 modules/video_output/win32/directdraw.c:1495
msgid "Default"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:544
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCAudioEffectsWindowController.m:223
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainWindow.m:997
#: modules/gui/qt/components/extended_panels.cpp:928
#: modules/gui/qt/ui/equalizer.h:133 modules/gui/qt/ui/vlm.h:289
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:546
msgid "MTU of the network interface"
msgstr "ຄ່າ MTU ຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:548
msgid ""
"This is the maximum application-layer packet size that can be transmitted "
"over the network (in bytes)."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຂະໜາດແພັກເກັດສູງສຸດໃນລະດັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ສາມາດສົ່ງຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍໄດ້ (ເປັນໄບຕ໌)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:553 modules/stream_out/rtp.c:124
msgid "Hop limit (TTL)"
msgstr "Hop limit (TTL)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:555 modules/stream_out/rtp.c:126
msgid ""
"This is the hop limit (also known as \"Time-To-Live\" or TTL) of the "
"multicast packets sent by the stream output (-1 = use operating system built-"
"in default)."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າ hop limit (ຫຼື \"Time-To-Live\" / TTL) ຂອງແພັກເກັດ multicast ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈາກສະຕຣີມ (-1 = ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:559
msgid "Multicast output interface"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ເອົາພຸດ Multicast"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:561
msgid "Default multicast interface. This overrides the routing table."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ multicast ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຂຽນທັບຕາຕະລາງ routing."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:563
msgid "DiffServ Code Point"
msgstr "DiffServ Code Point"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:564
msgid ""
"Differentiated Services Code Point for outgoing UDP streams (or IPv4 Type Of "
"Service, or IPv6 Traffic Class). This is used for network Quality of Service."
msgstr "Differentiated Services Code Point ສຳລັບສະຕຣີມ UDP ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ (ຫຼື IPv4 Type Of Service, ຫຼື IPv6 Traffic Class). ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄຸນນະພາບການບໍລິການເຄືອຂ່າຍ (QoS)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:570
msgid ""
"Choose the program to select by giving its Service ID. Only use this option "
"if you want to read a multi-program stream (like DVB streams for example)."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂປຣແກຣມໂດຍການລະບຸ Service ID. ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການອ່ານສະຕຣີມທີ່ມີຫຼາຍໂປຣແກຣມ (ເຊັ່ນ ສະຕຣີມ DVB)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:576
msgid ""
"Choose the programs to select by giving a comma-separated list of Service "
"IDs (SIDs). Only use this option if you want to read a multi-program stream "
"(like DVB streams for example)."
msgstr "ເລືອກຫຼາຍໂປຣແກຣມໂດຍການລະບຸລາຍຊື່ Service ID (SID) ທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍໝາຍຈຸດ. ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕ້ອງການອ່ານສະຕຣີມທີ່ມີຫຼາຍໂປຣແກຣມ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:582 modules/gui/qt/ui/open_disk.h:312
msgid "Audio track"
msgstr "ແທຣັກສຽງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:584
msgid "Stream number of the audio track to use (from 0 to n)."
msgstr "ເລກລຳດັບສະຕຣີມຂອງແທຣັກສຽງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ (ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ n)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:587 modules/gui/qt/ui/open_disk.h:313
msgid "Subtitle track"
msgstr "ແທຣັກຄຳບັນຍາຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:589
msgid "Stream number of the subtitle track to use (from 0 to n)."
msgstr "ເລກລຳດັບສະຕຣີມຂອງແທຣັກຄຳບັນຍາຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ (ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ n)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:592 modules/stream_out/transcode/transcode.c:97
msgid "Audio language"
msgstr "ພາສາຂອງສຽງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:594
msgid ""
"Language of the audio track you want to use (comma separated, two or three "
"letter country code, you may use 'none' to avoid a fallback to another "
"language)."
msgstr "ພາສາຂອງແທຣັກສຽງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ (ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍໝາຍຈຸດ, ໃຊ້ລະຫັດປະເທດ 2 ຫຼື 3 ຕົວອັກສອນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ 'none' ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ລະບົບປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ພາສາອື່ນໄດ້)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:597
msgid "Subtitle language"
msgstr "ພາສາຄຳບັນຍາຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:599
msgid ""
"Language of the subtitle track you want to use (comma separated, two or "
"three letters country code, you may use 'any' as a fallback)."
msgstr "ພາສາຂອງແທຣັກຄຳບັນຍາຍທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ (ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍໝາຍຈຸດ, ໃຊ້ລະຫັດປະເທດ 2 ຫຼື 3 ຕົວອັກສອນ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ 'any' ເປັນພາສາສຳຮອງໄດ້)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:602
msgid "Menu language"
msgstr "ພາສາຂອງເມນູ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:604
msgid ""
"Language of the menus you want to use with DVD/BluRay (comma separated, two "
"or three letters country code, you may use 'any' as a fallback)."
msgstr "ພາສາຂອງເມນູທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ກັບ DVD/BluRay (ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍໝາຍຈຸດ, ໃຊ້ລະຫັດປະເທດ 2 ຫຼື 3 ຕົວອັກສອນ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:608
msgid "Audio track ID"
msgstr "ID ຂອງແທຣັກສຽງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:610
msgid "Stream ID of the audio track to use."
msgstr "Stream ID ຂອງແທຣັກສຽງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:612
msgid "Subtitle track ID"
msgstr "ID ຂອງແທຣັກຄຳບັນຍາຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:614
msgid "Stream ID of the subtitle track to use."
msgstr "Stream ID ຂອງແທຣັກຄຳບັນຍາຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:616
msgid "Preferred Closed Captions decoder"
msgstr "ຕົວຖອດລະຫັດຄຳບັນຍາຍ (Closed Captions) ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:620
msgid "Preferred video resolution"
msgstr "ຄວາມລະອຽດວິດີໂອທີ່ຕ້ອງການ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:622
msgid ""
"When several video formats are available, select one whose resolution is "
"closest to (but not higher than) this setting, in number of lines. Use this "
"option if you don't have enough CPU power or network bandwidth to play "
"higher resolutions."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີຫຼາຍຮູບແບບວິດີໂອ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກອັນທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດ (ແຕ່ບໍ່ສູງກວ່າ) ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້. ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖ້າ CPU ຫຼື ເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ແຮງພໍທີ່ຈະຫຼິ້ນຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:628
msgid "Best available"
msgstr "ດີທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ມີ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:628
msgid "Full HD (1080p)"
msgstr "Full HD (1080p)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:628
msgid "HD (720p)"
msgstr "HD (720p)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:629
msgid "Standard Definition (576 or 480 lines)"
msgstr "ຄວາມລະອຽດມາດຕະຖານ (576 ຫຼື 480 ເສັ້ນ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:630
msgid "Low Definition (360 lines)"
msgstr "ຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ (360 ເສັ້ນ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:631
msgid "Very Low Definition (240 lines)"
msgstr "ຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳຫຼາຍ (240 ເສັ້ນ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:634
msgid "Input repetitions"
msgstr "ການຫຼິ້ນອິນພຸດຊ້ຳ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:636
msgid "Number of time the same input will be repeated"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຈະຫຼິ້ນອິນພຸດເດີມຊ້ຳ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:638 modules/gui/macosx/VLCOpenWindowController.m:159
msgid "Start time"
msgstr "ເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:640
msgid "The stream will start at this position (in seconds)."
msgstr "ສະຕຣີມຈະເລີ່ມທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງນີ້ (ເປັນວິນາທີ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:642 modules/gui/macosx/VLCOpenWindowController.m:161
msgid "Stop time"
msgstr "ເວລາຢຸດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:644
msgid "The stream will stop at this position (in seconds)."
msgstr "ສະຕຣີມຈະຢຸດທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງນີ້ (ເປັນວິນາທີ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:646
msgid "Run time"
msgstr "ເວລາເຮັດວຽກ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:648
msgid "The stream will run this duration (in seconds)."
msgstr "ສະຕຣີມຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມໄລຍະເວລານີ້ (ເປັນວິນາທີ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:650
msgid "Fast seek"
msgstr "ຊອກຫາແບບໄວ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:652
msgid "Favor speed over precision while seeking"
msgstr "ເນັ້ນຄວາມໄວຫຼາຍກວ່າຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳໃນເວລາຊອກຫາ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:654
msgid "Playback speed"
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວການຫຼິ້ນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:656
msgid "This defines the playback speed (nominal speed is 1.0)."
msgstr "ອັນນີ້ກຳນົດຄວາມໄວໃນການຫຼິ້ນ (ຄວາມໄວປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 1.0)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:658
msgid "Input list"
msgstr "ລາຍການອິນພຸດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:660
msgid ""
"You can give a comma-separated list of inputs that will be concatenated "
"together after the normal one."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸລາຍການອິນພຸດທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ (comma) ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກນຳມາຕໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນຫຼັງຈາກອັນປົກກະຕິ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:663
msgid "Input slave (experimental)"
msgstr "ອິນພຸດສຳຮອງ (ທົດລອງ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:665
msgid ""
"This allows you to play from several inputs at the same time. This feature "
"is experimental, not all formats are supported. Use a '#' separated list of "
"inputs."
msgstr "ອັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຫຼິ້ນຈາກຫຼາຍອິນພຸດໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນທົດລອງ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບທຸກຮູບແບບ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ '#' ຂັ້ນລາຍການອິນພຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:669
msgid "Bookmarks list for a stream"
msgstr "ລາຍການບຸກມາກສຳລັບສະຕຣີມ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:671
msgid ""
"You can manually give a list of bookmarks for a stream in the form "
"\"{name=bookmark-name,time=optional-time-offset,bytes=optional-byte-offset},"
"{...}\""
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸລາຍການບຸກມາກສຳລັບສະຕຣີມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນຮູບແບບ \"{name=ຊື່ບຸກມາກ,time=ເວລາເລີ່ມ,bytes=ໄລຍະໄບຕ໌},{...}\""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:675
msgid "Record directory"
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີເກັບການບັນທຶກ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:677
msgid "Directory where the records will be stored"
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີບ່ອນທີ່ຈະເກັບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:679
msgid "Prefer native stream recording"
msgstr "ບຸລິມະສິດການບັນທຶກສະຕຣີມແບບຕົ້ນສະບັບ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:681
msgid ""
"When possible, the input stream will be recorded instead of using the stream "
"output module"
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້, ຈະບັນທຶກສະຕຣີມອິນພຸດໂດຍກົງ ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂມດູນສະຕຣີມເອົາທ໌ພຸດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:684
msgid "Timeshift directory"
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີ Timeshift"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:686
msgid "Directory used to store the timeshift temporary files."
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວຂອງ timeshift."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:688
msgid "Timeshift granularity"
msgstr "ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ Timeshift"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:690
msgid ""
"This is the maximum size in bytes of the temporary files that will be used "
"to store the timeshifted streams."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຂະໜາດສູງສຸດເປັນໄບຕ໌ຂອງໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເກັບສະຕຣີມຂອງ timeshift."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:693
msgid "Change title according to current media"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຫົວຂໍ້ຕາມສື່ທີ່ຫຼິ້ນປັດຈຸບັນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:694
msgid ""
"This option allows you to set the title according to what's being "
"played<br>$a: Artist<br>$b: Album<br>$c: Copyright<br>$t: Title<br>$g: "
"Genre<br>$n: Track num<br>$p: Now playing<br>$A: Date<br>$D: Duration<br>$Z: "
"\"Now playing\" (Fall back on Title - Artist)"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຫົວຂໍ້ຕາມສິ່ງທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນ<br>$a: ສິລະປິນ<br>$b: ອັນລະບັ້ມ<br>$c: ລິຂະສິດ<br>$t: ຊື່ເພງ/ຫົວຂໍ້<br>$g: ແນວເພງ<br>$n: ເລກລຳດັບແທຣັກ<br>$p: ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນ<br>$A: ວັນທີ<br>$D: ໄລຍະເວລາ<br>$Z: \"ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນ\" (ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຈະໃຊ້ ຊື່ - ສິລະປິນ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:699
msgid "Disable all lua plugins"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານປລັກອິນ lua ທັງໝົດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:703
msgid ""
"These options allow you to modify the behavior of the subpictures subsystem. "
"You can for example enable subpictures sources (logo, etc.). Enable these "
"filters here and configure them in the \"subsources filters\" modules "
"section. You can also set many miscellaneous subpictures options."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບແຕ່ງລະບົບພາບຍ່ອຍ. ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງພາບຍ່ອຍ (ໂລໂກ້ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ). ເປີດໃຊ້ຟິວເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນສ່ວນໂມດູນ \"subsources filters\". ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າພາບຍ່ອຍອື່ນໆໄດ້ອີກ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:709 modules/gui/qt/ui/sprefs_subtitles.h:305
msgid "Force subtitle position"
msgstr "ບັງຄັບຕຳແໜ່ງຄຳບັນຍາຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:711
msgid ""
"You can use this option to place the subtitles under the movie, instead of "
"over the movie. Try several positions."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອວາງຄຳບັນຍາຍໄວ້ລຸ່ມຮູບເງົາ ແທນທີ່ຈະວາງທັບເທິງຮູບເງົາ. ລອງທົດສອບຫຼາຍໆຕຳແໜ່ງ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:714
msgid "Subtitles text scaling factor"
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນຂະໜາດຕົວອັກສອນຄຳບັນຍາຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:715
msgid "Changes the subtitles size where possible"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຄຳບັນຍາຍໃນບ່ອນທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:717
msgid "Enable sub-pictures"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານພາບຍ່ອຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:719
msgid "You can completely disable the sub-picture processing."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການປະມວນຜົນພາບຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດໄດ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:721 src/libvlc-module.c:1668 src/text/iso-639_def.h:145
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:338
#: modules/gui/qt/ui/sprefs_subtitles.h:290
msgid "On Screen Display"
msgstr "ການສະແດງຜົນເທິງໜ້າຈໍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:723
msgid ""
"VLC can display messages on the video. This is called OSD (On Screen "
"Display)."
msgstr "VLC ສາມາດສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມເທິງວິດີໂອໄດ້. ອັນນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ OSD (On Screen Display)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:726
msgid "Text rendering module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການສະແດງຜົນຕົວອັກສອນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:728
msgid ""
"VLC normally uses Freetype for rendering, but this allows you to use svg for "
"instance."
msgstr "ປົກກະຕິ VLC ໃຊ້ Freetype ໃນການສະແດງຜົນ, ແຕ່ອັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ svg ແທນໄດ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:730
msgid "Subpictures source module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນແຫຼ່ງພາບຍ່ອຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:732
msgid ""
"This adds so-called \"subpicture sources\". These filters overlay some "
"images or text over the video (like a logo, arbitrary text, ...)."
msgstr "ອັນນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມ \"ແຫຼ່ງພາບຍ່ອຍ\". ຟິວເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະວາງຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ຕົວອັກສອນທັບເທິງວິດີໂອ (ເຊັ່ນ ໂລໂກ້, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຕ່າງໆ...)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:735
msgid "Subpictures filter module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນຟິວເຕີພາບຍ່ອຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:737
msgid ""
"This adds so-called \"subpicture filters\". These filter subpictures created "
"by subtitle decoders or other subpictures sources."
msgstr "ອັນນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມ \"ຟິວເຕີພາບຍ່ອຍ\". ເຊິ່ງຈະກັ່ນຕອງພາບຍ່ອຍທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍຕົວຖອດລະຫັດຄຳບັນຍາຍ ຫຼື ແຫຼ່ງພາບຍ່ອຍອື່ນໆ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:740
msgid "Autodetect subtitle files"
msgstr "ກວດຫາໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:742
msgid ""
"Automatically detect a subtitle file, if no subtitle filename is specified "
"(based on the filename of the movie)."
msgstr "ກວດຫາໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍໄວ້ (ໂດຍອີງຕາມຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂອງຮູບເງົາ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:745
msgid "Subtitle autodetection fuzziness"
msgstr "ລະດັບຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນໃນການກວດຫາຄຳບັນຍາຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:747
msgid ""
"This determines how fuzzy subtitle and movie filename matching will be. "
"Options are:\n"
"0 = no subtitles autodetected\n"
"1 = any subtitle file\n"
"2 = any subtitle file containing the movie name\n"
"3 = subtitle file matching the movie name with additional chars\n"
"4 = subtitle file matching the movie name exactly"
msgstr ""
"ອັນນີ້ກຳນົດລະດັບຄວາມຄ້າຍຄືກັນໃນການຈັບຄູ່ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍ ແລະ ຮູບເງົາ. ຕົວເລືອກຄື:\n"
"0 = ບໍ່ຕ້ອງກວດຫາອັດຕະໂນມັດ\n"
"1 = ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍໃດໆກໍໄດ້\n"
"2 = ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍທີ່ມີຊື່ຮູບເງົາປົນຢູ່\n"
"3 = ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍທີ່ກົງກັບຊື່ຮູບເງົາໂດຍມີຕົວອັກສອນເພີ່ມເຕີມ\n"
"4 = ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍທີ່ຊື່ກົງກັບຮູບເງົາແບບເປະໆ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:755
msgid "Subtitle autodetection paths"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງການກວດຫາຄຳບັນຍາຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:757
msgid ""
"Look for a subtitle file in those paths too, if your subtitle file was not "
"found in the current directory."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍໃນເສັ້ນທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍ ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບໄຟລ໌ໃນໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:760
msgid "Use subtitle file"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:762
msgid ""
"Load this subtitle file. To be used when autodetect cannot detect your "
"subtitle file."
msgstr "ໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍນີ້. ໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ລະບົບອັດຕະໂນມັດບໍ່ສາມາດກວດຫາໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:766
msgid "DVD device"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນ DVD"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:767
msgid "VCD device"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນ VCD"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:768 modules/access/cdda.c:701
msgid "Audio CD device"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນ Audio CD"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:772
msgid ""
"This is the default DVD drive (or file) to use. Don't forget the colon after "
"the drive letter (e.g. D:)"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນໄດຣຟ໌ DVD (ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌) ຫຼັກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຢ່າລືມໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈ້ຳສອງເມັດ (colon) ຫຼັງຕົວອັກສອນໄດຣຟ໌ (ເຊັ່ນ D:)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:775
msgid ""
"This is the default VCD drive (or file) to use. Don't forget the colon after "
"the drive letter (e.g. D:)"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນໄດຣຟ໌ VCD (ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌) ຫຼັກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຢ່າລືມໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈ້ຳສອງເມັດ (colon) ຫຼັງຕົວອັກສອນໄດຣຟ໌ (ເຊັ່ນ D:)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:778 modules/access/cdda.c:704
msgid ""
"This is the default Audio CD drive (or file) to use. Don't forget the colon "
"after the drive letter (e.g. D:)"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນໄດຣຟ໌ Audio CD (ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌) ຫຼັກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຢ່າລືມໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈ້ຳສອງເມັດ (colon) ຫຼັງຕົວອັກສອນໄດຣຟ໌ (ເຊັ່ນ D:)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:785
msgid "This is the default DVD device to use."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນອຸປະກອນ DVD ຫຼັກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:787
msgid "This is the default VCD device to use."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນອຸປະກອນ VCD ຫຼັກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:789 modules/access/cdda.c:709
msgid "This is the default Audio CD device to use."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນອຸປະກອນ Audio CD ຫຼັກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:803
msgid "TCP connection timeout"
msgstr "ເວລາໝົດກຳນົດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:805
msgid "Default TCP connection timeout (in milliseconds)."
msgstr "ເວລາໝົດກຳນົດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ຫຼັກ (ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:807
msgid "HTTP server address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ເຊີເວີ HTTP"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:809
msgid ""
"By default, the server will listen on any local IP address. Specify an IP "
"address (e.g. ::1 or 127.0.0.1) or a host name (e.g. localhost) to restrict "
"them to a specific network interface."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ ເຊີເວີຈະລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກທຸກ IP ໃນເຄື່ອງ. ໃຫ້ລະບຸ IP (ເຊັ່ນ ::1 ຫຼື 127.0.0.1) ຫຼື ຊື່ໂຮສຕ໌ (ເຊັ່ນ localhost) ເພື່ອຈຳກັດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:813
msgid "RTSP server address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ເຊີເວີ RTSP"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:815
msgid ""
"This defines the address the RTSP server will listen on, along with the base "
"path of the RTSP VOD media. Syntax is address/path. By default, the server "
"will listen on any local IP address. Specify an IP address (e.g. ::1 or "
"127.0.0.1) or a host name (e.g. localhost) to restrict them to a specific "
"network interface."
msgstr "ອັນນີ້ກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີ RTSP ຈະລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ພ້ອມກັບເສັ້ນທາງຫຼັກຂອງສື່ RTSP VOD. ຮູບແບບຄື ທີ່ຢູ່/ເສັ້ນທາງ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະລໍຖ້າທຸກ IP. ໃຫ້ລະບຸ IP ຫຼື ຊື່ໂຮສຕ໌ເພື່ອຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:821
msgid "HTTP server port"
msgstr "ພອດເຊີເວີ HTTP"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:823
msgid ""
"The HTTP server will listen on this TCP port. The standard HTTP port number "
"is 80. However allocation of port numbers below 1025 is usually restricted "
"by the operating system."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ HTTP ຈະໃຊ້ພອດ TCP ນີ້. ພອດ HTTP ມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ 80. ແຕ່ການໃຊ້ພອດທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 1025 ມັກຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:828
msgid "HTTPS server port"
msgstr "ພອດເຊີເວີ HTTPS"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:830
msgid ""
"The HTTPS server will listen on this TCP port. The standard HTTPS port "
"number is 443. However allocation of port numbers below 1025 is usually "
"restricted by the operating system."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ HTTPS ຈະໃຊ້ພອດ TCP ນີ້. ພອດ HTTPS ມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ 443. ແຕ່ການໃຊ້ພອດທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 1025 ມັກຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:835
msgid "RTSP server port"
msgstr "ພອດເຊີເວີ RTSP"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:837
msgid ""
"The RTSP server will listen on this TCP port. The standard RTSP port number "
"is 554. However allocation of port numbers below 1025 is usually restricted "
"by the operating system."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ RTSP ຈະໃຊ້ພອດ TCP ນີ້. ພອດ RTSP ມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ 554. ແຕ່ການໃຊ້ພອດທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 1025 ມັກຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:842
msgid "HTTP/TLS server certificate"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ HTTP/TLS"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:844
msgid ""
"This X.509 certicate file (PEM format) is used for server-side TLS. On OS X, "
"the string is used as a label to search the certificate in the keychain."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ X.509 (ຮູບແບບ PEM) ນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ TLS ຝັ່ງເຊີເວີ. ໃນ OS X ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນປ້າຍຊື່ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນ keychain."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:847
msgid "HTTP/TLS server private key"
msgstr "ຄີສ່ວນຕົວຂອງເຊີເວີ HTTP/TLS"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:849
msgid "This private key file (PEM format) is used for server-side TLS."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຄີສ່ວນຕົວ (ຮູບແບບ PEM) ນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ TLS ຝັ່ງເຊີເວີ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:851
msgid "SOCKS server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ SOCKS"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:853
msgid ""
"SOCKS proxy server to use. This must be of the form address:port. It will be "
"used for all TCP connections"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ SOCKS proxy ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ ທີ່ຢູ່:ພອດ. ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກັບທຸກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:856
msgid "SOCKS user name"
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ SOCKS"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:858
msgid "User name to be used for connection to the SOCKS proxy."
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ SOCKS proxy."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:860
msgid "SOCKS password"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານ SOCKS"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:862
msgid "Password to be used for connection to the SOCKS proxy."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ SOCKS proxy."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:864
msgid "Title metadata"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ ຫົວຂໍ້"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:866
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"title\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານລະບຸເມຕາເດຕາ \"title\" (ຫົວຂໍ້) ສຳລັບອິນພຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:868
msgid "Author metadata"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ ຜູ້ຂຽນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:870
msgid "Allows you to specify an \"author\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານລະບຸເມຕາເດຕາ \"author\" (ຜູ້ຂຽນ) ສຳລັບອິນພຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:872
msgid "Artist metadata"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ ສິລະປິນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:874
msgid "Allows you to specify an \"artist\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານລະບຸເມຕາເດຕາ \"artist\" (ສິລະປິນ) ສຳລັບອິນພຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:876
msgid "Genre metadata"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ ແນວເພງ/ປະເພດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:878
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"genre\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານລະບຸເມຕາເດຕາ \"genre\" (ແນວເພງ) ສຳລັບອິນພຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:880
msgid "Copyright metadata"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ ລິຂະສິດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:882
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"copyright\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານລະບຸເມຕາເດຕາ \"copyright\" (ລິຂະສິດ) ສຳລັບອິນພຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:884
msgid "Description metadata"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ ຄຳອະທິບາຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:886
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"description\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານລະບຸເມຕາເດຕາ \"description\" (ຄຳອະທິບາຍ) ສຳລັບອິນພຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:888
msgid "Date metadata"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ ວັນທີ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:890
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"date\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານລະບຸເມຕາເດຕາ \"date\" (ວັນທີ) ສຳລັບອິນພຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:892
msgid "URL metadata"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ URL"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:894
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"url\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານລະບຸເມຕາເດຕາ \"url\" ສຳລັບອິນພຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:898
msgid ""
"This option can be used to alter the way VLC selects its codecs "
"(decompression methods). Only advanced users should alter this option as it "
"can break playback of all your streams."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນວິທີທີ່ VLC ເລືອກໃຊ້ຕົວຖອດລະຫັດ (codec). ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບສູງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຄວນປັບແຕ່ງ ເພາະອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມທັງໝົດມີບັນຫາ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:902
msgid "Preferred decoders list"
msgstr "ລາຍການຕົວຖອດລະຫັດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:904
msgid ""
"List of codecs that VLC will use in priority. For instance, 'dummy,a52' will "
"try the dummy and a52 codecs before trying the other ones. Only advanced "
"users should alter this option as it can break playback of all your streams."
msgstr "ລາຍການ codec ທີ່ VLC ຈະເລືອກໃຊ້ກ່ອນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ 'dummy,a52' ຈະລອງໃຊ້ dummy ແລະ a52 ກ່ອນອັນອື່ນ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບສູງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຄວນປັບແຕ່ງ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:909
msgid "Preferred encoders list"
msgstr "ລາຍການຕົວເຂົ້າລະຫັດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:911
msgid ""
"This allows you to select a list of encoders that VLC will use in priority."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກລາຍການຕົວເຂົ້າລະຫັດ (encoder) ທີ່ VLC ຈະເລືອກໃຊ້ກ່ອນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:920
msgid ""
"These options allow you to set default global options for the stream output "
"subsystem."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼັກສຳລັບລະບົບສະຕຣີມເອົາທ໌ພຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:923
msgid "Default stream output chain"
msgstr "ສາຍງານສະຕຣີມເອົາທ໌ພຸດຫຼັກ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:925
msgid ""
"You can enter here a default stream output chain. Refer to the documentation "
"to learn how to build such chains. Warning: this chain will be enabled for "
"all streams."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸສາຍງານ (chain) ສະຕຣີມເອົາທ໌ພຸດຫຼັກຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້. ຄຳເຕືອນ: ສາຍງານນີ້ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ກັບທຸກສະຕຣີມ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:929
msgid "Enable streaming of all ES"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການສະຕຣີມ ES ທັງໝົດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:931
msgid "Stream all elementary streams (video, audio and subtitles)"
msgstr "ສະຕຣີມທຸກໆສ່ວນປະກອບ (ວິດີໂອ, ສຽງ ແລະ ຄຳບັນຍາຍ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:933
msgid "Display while streaming"
msgstr "ສະແດງຜົນໃນຂະນະທີ່ສະຕຣີມ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:935
msgid "Play locally the stream while streaming it."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງໄປພ້ອມໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງສະຕຣີມອອກໄປ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:937
msgid "Enable video stream output"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ສະຕຣີມເອົາທ໌ພຸດວິດີໂອ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:939
msgid ""
"Choose whether the video stream should be redirected to the stream output "
"facility when this last one is enabled."
msgstr "ເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ສະຕຣີມວິດີໂອຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງສ່ວນເອົາທ໌ພຸດຫຼືບໍ່ ເມື່ອມີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:942
msgid "Enable audio stream output"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ສະຕຣີມເອົາທ໌ພຸດສຽງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:944
msgid ""
"Choose whether the audio stream should be redirected to the stream output "
"facility when this last one is enabled."
msgstr "ເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ສະຕຣີມສຽງຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງສ່ວນເອົາທ໌ພຸດຫຼືບໍ່ ເມື່ອມີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:947
msgid "Enable SPU stream output"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ສະຕຣີມເອົາທ໌ພຸດ SPU"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:949
msgid ""
"Choose whether the SPU streams should be redirected to the stream output "
"facility when this last one is enabled."
msgstr "ເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ສະຕຣີມ SPU ຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງສ່ວນເອົາທ໌ພຸດຫຼືບໍ່ ເມື່ອມີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:952
msgid "Keep stream output open"
msgstr "ເປີດສະຕຣີມເອົາທ໌ພຸດຄ້າງໄວ້"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:954
msgid ""
"This allows you to keep an unique stream output instance across multiple "
"playlist item (automatically insert the gather stream output if not "
"specified)"
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ສະຕຣີມເອົາທ໌ພຸດອັນດຽວຕໍ່ເນື່ອງກັນໄປໃນຫຼາຍໆລາຍການ (ຈະໃສ່ gather stream output ໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:958
msgid "Stream output muxer caching (ms)"
msgstr "ແຄຊຊິງຂອງຕົວລວມສັນຍານສະຕຣີມ (ມິນລິວິນາທີ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:960
msgid ""
"This allow you to configure the initial caching amount for stream output "
"muxer. This value should be set in milliseconds."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າແຄຊຊິງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຕົວລວມສັນຍານສະຕຣີມ. ຄ່ານີ້ຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:963
msgid "Preferred packetizer list"
msgstr "ລາຍການ packetizer ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:965
msgid ""
"This allows you to select the order in which VLC will choose its packetizers."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກລຳດັບທີ່ VLC ຈະເລືອກໃຊ້ packetizers."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:968
msgid "Mux module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ Mux"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:970
msgid "This is a legacy entry to let you configure mux modules"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນລາຍການແບບເກົ່າເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າໂມດູນ mux"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:972
msgid "Access output module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ Access output"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:974
msgid "This is a legacy entry to let you configure access output modules"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນລາຍການແບບເກົ່າເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າໂມດູນ access output"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:977
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the flow on the SAP multicast address will be "
"controlled. This is needed if you want to make announcements on the MBone."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ການໄຫຼຂອງຂໍ້ມູນໃນທີ່ຢູ່ SAP multicast ຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມ. ຈຳເປັນຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປະກາດໃນ MBone."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:981
msgid "SAP announcement interval"
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງການປະກາດ SAP"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:983
msgid ""
"When the SAP flow control is disabled, this lets you set the fixed interval "
"between SAP announcements."
msgstr "ເມື່ອປິດການຄວບຄຸມການໄຫຼຂອງ SAP, ອັນນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງໄລຍະຫ່າງຄົງທີ່ລະຫວ່າງການປະກາດ SAP."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:992
msgid ""
"These options allow you to select default modules. Leave these alone unless "
"you really know what you are doing."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກໂມດູນຫຼັກ. ບໍ່ຄວນປ່ຽນແປງຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ເຂົ້າໃຈດີພໍ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:995
msgid "Access module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ Access"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:997
msgid ""
"This allows you to force an access module. You can use it if the correct "
"access is not automatically detected. You should not set this as a global "
"option unless you really know what you are doing."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານບັງຄັບໃຊ້ໂມດູນ access. ໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ລະບົບກວດຫາບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ບໍ່ຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າຫຼັກຖ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1001
msgid "Stream filter module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນຟິວເຕີສະຕຣີມ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1003
msgid "Stream filters are used to modify the stream that is being read."
msgstr "ຟິວເຕີສະຕຣີມໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງສະຕຣີມທີ່ກຳລັງອ່ານຢູ່."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1005
msgid "Demux filter module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນຟິວເຕີ Demux"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1007
msgid "Demux filters are used to modify/control the stream that is being read."
msgstr "ຟິວເຕີ Demux ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງ ຫຼື ຄວບຄຸມສະຕຣີມທີ່ກຳລັງອ່ານຢູ່."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1009
msgid "Demux module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ Demux"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1011
msgid ""
"Demultiplexers are used to separate the \"elementary\" streams (like audio "
"and video streams). You can use it if the correct demuxer is not "
"automatically detected. You should not set this as a global option unless "
"you really know what you are doing."
msgstr "Demultiplexers ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກສະຕຣີມສຽງ ແລະ ວິດີໂອອອກຈາກກັນ. ບໍ່ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ເຂົ້າໃຈວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງມັນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1016
msgid "VoD server module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນເຊີເວີ VoD"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1018
msgid ""
"You can select which VoD server module you want to use. Set this to "
"'vod_rtsp' to switch back to the old, legacy module."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໂມດູນເຊີເວີ VoD ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ຕັ້ງເປັນ 'vod_rtsp' ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໂມດູນແບບເກົ່າ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1021
msgid "Allow real-time priority"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ບຸລິມະສິດແບບເວລາຈິງ (Real-time)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1023
msgid ""
"Running VLC in real-time priority will allow for much more precise "
"scheduling and yield better, especially when streaming content. It can "
"however lock up your whole machine, or make it very very slow. You should "
"only activate this if you know what you're doing."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ VLC ໃນລະດັບ Real-time ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການປະມວນຜົນແມ່ນຍຳຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງຄ້າງ ຫຼື ຊ້າລົງຫຼາຍ. ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈຜົນກະທົບເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1029
msgid "Adjust VLC priority"
msgstr "ປັບລະດັບບຸລິມະສິດຂອງ VLC"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1031
msgid ""
"This option adds an offset (positive or negative) to VLC default priorities. "
"You can use it to tune VLC priority against other programs, or against other "
"VLC instances."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດລະດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງ VLC ເມື່ອທຽບກັບໂປຣແກຣມອື່ນໆ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1036
msgid ""
"This option is useful if you want to lower the latency when reading a stream"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຫຼຸດການດີເລ (latency) ໃນເວລາອ່ານສະຕຣີມ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1039
msgid "VLM configuration file"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ VLM"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1041
msgid "Read a VLM configuration file as soon as VLM is started."
msgstr "ອ່ານໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ VLM ທັນທີທີ່ VLM ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1043
msgid "Use a plugins cache"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ແຄຊຂອງປລັກອິນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1045
msgid "Use a plugins cache which will greatly improve the startup time of VLC."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ແຄຊຂອງປລັກອິນເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ VLC ເປີດໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1047
msgid "Scan for new plugins"
msgstr "ສະແກນຫາປລັກອິນໃໝ່"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1049
msgid ""
"Scan plugin directories for new plugins at startup. This increases the "
"startup time of VLC."
msgstr "ສະແກນຫາປລັກອິນໃໝ່ໃນເວລາເປີດໂປຣແກຣມ. ອັນນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ VLC ເປີດຊ້າລົງ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1052
msgid "Preferred keystore list"
msgstr "ລາຍການບ່ອນເກັບຄີທີ່ຕ້ອງການ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1054
msgid "List of keystores that VLC will use in priority."
msgstr "ລາຍການບ່ອນເກັບຄີທີ່ VLC ຈະເລືອກໃຊ້ກ່ອນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1056
msgid "Locally collect statistics"
msgstr "ເກັບກຳສະຖິຕິໃນເຄື່ອງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1058
msgid "Collect miscellaneous local statistics about the playing media."
msgstr "ເກັບກຳສະຖິຕິຕ່າງໆໃນເຄື່ອງກ່ຽວກັບສື່ທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1060
msgid "Run as daemon process"
msgstr "ເຮັດວຽກແບບ Daemon (ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1062
msgid "Runs VLC as a background daemon process."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ VLC ເຮັດວຽກເປັນໂປຣແກຣມເບື້ອງຫຼັງ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1064
msgid "Write process id to file"
msgstr "ຂຽນ Process ID ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1066
msgid "Writes process id into specified file."
msgstr "ຂຽນເລກ Process ID ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1068
msgid "Allow only one running instance"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເປີດໄດ້ພຽງໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1070
msgid ""
"Allowing only one running instance of VLC can sometimes be useful, for "
"example if you associated VLC with some media types and you don't want a new "
"instance of VLC to be opened each time you open a file in your file manager. "
"This option will allow you to play the file with the already running "
"instance or enqueue it."
msgstr "ຈຳກັດໃຫ້ເປີດ VLC ໄດ້ພຽງອັນດຽວ. ຖ້າເປີດໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ ມັນຈະໄປຫຼິ້ນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງເດີມ ຫຼື ຕໍ່ຄິວໄວ້ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປີດໂປຣແກຣມໃໝ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1076
msgid "VLC is started from file association"
msgstr "VLC ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກຈາກການເປີດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1078
msgid "Tell VLC that it is being launched due to a file association in the OS"
msgstr "ແຈ້ງໃຫ້ VLC ຊາບວ່າມັນຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປີດໄຟລ໌ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1081 modules/gui/qt/ui/sprefs_interface.h:551
msgid "Use only one instance when started from file manager"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ພຽງໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວເມື່ອເປີດຈາກຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1083
msgid "Increase the priority of the process"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມລະດັບບຸລິມະສິດຂອງໂປຣແກຣມ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1085
msgid ""
"Increasing the priority of the process will very likely improve your playing "
"experience as it allows VLC not to be disturbed by other applications that "
"could otherwise take too much processor time. However be advised that in "
"certain circumstances (bugs) VLC could take all the processor time and "
"render the whole system unresponsive which might require a reboot of your "
"machine."
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມບຸລິມະສິດຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອໄດ້ມື່ນຂຶ້ນ ເພາະບໍ່ຖືກແອັບຯອື່ນແຍກຊັບພະຍາກອນ ແຕ່ຖ້າມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດກໍອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງຄ້າງໄດ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1093 modules/gui/qt/ui/sprefs_interface.h:554
msgid "Enqueue items into playlist in one instance mode"
msgstr "ເອົາລາຍການເຂົ້າຄິວໃນລາຍການຫຼິ້ນເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນໂໝດໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1095
msgid ""
"When using the one instance only option, enqueue items to playlist and keep "
"playing current item."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນຄິວ ແລະ ຫຼິ້ນໄຟລ໌ປັດຈຸບັນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1098
msgid "Expose media player via D-Bus"
msgstr "ສະແດງຕົວຫຼິ້ນສື່ຜ່ານ D-Bus"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1099
msgid "Allow other applications to control VLC using the D-Bus MPRIS protocol."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບຯອື່ນຄວບຄຸມ VLC ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ D-Bus MPRIS."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1108
msgid ""
"These options define the behavior of the playlist. Some of them can be "
"overridden in the playlist dialog box."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳຂອງລາຍການຫຼິ້ນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1111
msgid "Automatically preparse items"
msgstr "ກວດສອບລາຍການອັດຕະໂນມັດກ່ອນຫຼິ້ນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1113
msgid ""
"Automatically preparse items added to the playlist (to retrieve some "
"metadata)."
msgstr "ກວດສອບລາຍການທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການຫຼິ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1116
msgid "Preparsing timeout"
msgstr "ໝົດເວລາການກວດສອບກ່ອນຫຼິ້ນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1118
msgid "Maximum time allowed to preparse an item, in milliseconds"
msgstr "ເວລາສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກວດສອບລາຍການ, ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1120 modules/gui/macosx/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:321
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun.cpp:95
#: modules/gui/qt/ui/sprefs_interface.h:564
msgid "Allow metadata network access"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄືອຂ່າຍເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1125
msgid "Collapse"
msgstr "ຫຍໍ້ເຂົ້າ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1125
msgid "Expand"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍອອກ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1127
msgid "Subdirectory behavior"
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1129
msgid ""
"Select whether subdirectories must be expanded.\n"
"none: subdirectories do not appear in the playlist.\n"
"collapse: subdirectories appear but are expanded on first play.\n"
"expand: all subdirectories are expanded.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"none: ບໍ່ສະແດງໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ.\n"
"collapse: ສະແດງແຕ່ຈະຂະຫຍາຍເມື່ອເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ.\n"
"expand: ຂະຫຍາຍໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດ.\n"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1134
msgid "Ignored extensions"
msgstr "ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ສົນໃຈ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1136
msgid ""
"Files with these extensions will not be added to playlist when opening a "
"directory.\n"
"This is useful if you add directories that contain playlist files for "
"instance. Use a comma-separated list of extensions."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການຫຼິ້ນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຈຸດ (comma) ຂັ້ນແຕ່ລະນາມສະກຸນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1141
msgid "Show hidden files"
msgstr "ສະແດງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຊື່ອງໄວ້"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1143
msgid "Ignore files starting with '.'"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສົນໃຈໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ '.'"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1145
msgid "Services discovery modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນຄົ້ນຫາບໍລິການ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1147
msgid ""
"Specifies the services discovery modules to preload, separated by colons. "
"Typical value is \"sap\"."
msgstr "ລະບຸໂມດູນຄົ້ນຫາບໍລິການທີ່ຈະໂຫຼດໄວ້ກ່ອນ, ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈ້ຳສອງເມັດ. ຄ່າປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ \"sap\"."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1150
msgid "Play files randomly forever"
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນໄຟລ໌ແບບສຸ່ມໄປຕະຫຼອດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1152
msgid "VLC will randomly play files in the playlist until interrupted."
msgstr "VLC ຈະຫຼິ້ນໄຟລ໌ໃນລາຍການຫຼິ້ນແບບສຸ່ມໄປເລື້ອຍໆ ຈົນກວ່າຈະຖືກສັ່ງຢຸດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1154
msgid "Repeat all"
msgstr "ຊ້ຳທັງໝົດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1156
msgid "VLC will keep playing the playlist indefinitely."
msgstr "VLC ຈະຫຼິ້ນລາຍການຫຼິ້ນຊ້ຳໄປເລື້ອຍໆ ບໍ່ມີກຳນົດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1158
msgid "Repeat current item"
msgstr "ຊ້ຳລາຍການປັດຈຸບັນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1160
msgid "VLC will keep playing the current playlist item."
msgstr "VLC ຈະຫຼິ້ນລາຍການປັດຈຸບັນຊ້ຳໄປເລື້ອຍໆ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1162
msgid "Play and stop"
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນແລ້ວຢຸດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1164
msgid "Stop the playlist after each played playlist item."
msgstr "ຢຸດລາຍການຫຼິ້ນຫຼັງຈາກຫຼິ້ນແຕ່ລະລາຍການຈົບ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1166
msgid "Play and exit"
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນແລ້ວອອກ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1168
msgid "Exit if there are no more items in the playlist."
msgstr "ອອກຈາກໂປຣແກຣມຖ້າບໍ່ມີລາຍການໃນລາຍການຫຼິ້ນແລ້ວ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1170
msgid "Play and pause"
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນແລ້ວພັກ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1172
msgid "Pause each item in the playlist on the last frame."
msgstr "ພັກແຕ່ລະລາຍການໃນລາຍການຫຼິ້ນໄວ້ທີ່ເຟຣມສຸດທ້າຍ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1174
msgid "Start paused"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການພັກ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1176
msgid "Pause each item in the playlist on the first frame."
msgstr "ພັກແຕ່ລະລາຍການໃນລາຍການຫຼິ້ນໄວ້ທີ່ເຟຣມທຳອິດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1178
msgid "Auto start"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1179
msgid "Automatically start playing the playlist content once it's loaded."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນລາຍການຫຼິ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດທັນທີທີ່ໂຫຼດສຳເລັດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1182
msgid "Pause on audio communication"
msgstr "ພັກເມື່ອມີການສື່ສານທາງສຽງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1184
msgid ""
"If pending audio communication is detected, playback will be paused "
"automatically."
msgstr "ຖ້າກວດພົບວ່າມີການໂທ ຫຼື ການສື່ສານທາງສຽງ, ຈະພັກການຫຼິ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1187
msgid "Use media library"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຫ້ອງສະໝຸດສື່"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1189
msgid ""
"The media library is automatically saved and reloaded each time you start "
"VLC."
msgstr "ຫ້ອງສະໝຸດສື່ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກ ແລະ ໂຫຼດໃໝ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ເປີດ VLC."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1192 modules/gui/qt/ui/sprefs_interface.h:552
msgid "Display playlist tree"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍການຫຼິ້ນແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1194
msgid ""
"The playlist can use a tree to categorize some items, like the contents of a "
"directory."
msgstr "ລາຍການຫຼິ້ນສາມາດສະແດງແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້ເພື່ອແຍກໝວດໝູ່ ເຊັ່ນ ຕາມເນື້ອໃນຂອງໂຟນເດີ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1203
msgid "These settings are the global VLC key bindings, known as \"hotkeys\"."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນການກຳນົດປຸ່ມລັດຂອງ VLC ຫຼື ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"hotkeys\"."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1208 modules/gui/macosx/VLCMain+OldPrefs.m:103
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສົນໃຈ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1208
msgid "Volume control"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມລະດັບສຽງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1209
msgid "Position control"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມຕຳແໜ່ງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1209
msgid "Position control reversed"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມຕຳແໜ່ງແບບປີ້ນກັບ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1212
msgid "Mouse wheel vertical axis control"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ແນວຕັ້ງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1214
msgid ""
"The mouse wheel vertical (up/down) axis can control volume, position or be "
"ignored."
msgstr "ລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ແນວຕັ້ງ (ຂຶ້ນ/ລົງ) ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມສຽງ, ຕຳແໜ່ງ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1216
msgid "Mouse wheel horizontal axis control"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ແນວນອນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1218
msgid ""
"The mouse wheel horizontal (left/right) axis can control volume, position or "
"be ignored."
msgstr "ລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ແນວນອນ (ຊ້າຍ/ຂວາ) ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມສຽງ, ຕຳແໜ່ງ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1220 src/video_output/vout_intf.c:268
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCControlsBarCommon.m:81
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:422 modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:501
#: modules/gui/qt/components/controller.hpp:108
#: modules/gui/qt/ui/sprefs_video.h:314
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "ເຕັມຈໍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1221
msgid "Select the hotkey to use to swap fullscreen state."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອສະຫຼັບການສະແດງຜົນເຕັມຈໍ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1222
msgid "Exit fullscreen"
msgstr "ອອກຈາກເຕັມຈໍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1223
msgid "Select the hotkey to use to exit fullscreen state."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອອອກຈາກການສະແດງຜົນເຕັມຈໍ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1224 modules/gui/macosx/VLCFSPanelController.m:109
msgid "Play/Pause"
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນ/ພັກ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1225
msgid "Select the hotkey to use to swap paused state."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອສະຫຼັບສະຖານະການພັກ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1226
msgid "Pause only"
msgstr "ພັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1227
msgid "Select the hotkey to use to pause."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອສັ່ງພັກ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1228
msgid "Play only"
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1229
msgid "Select the hotkey to use to play."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອສັ່ງຫຼິ້ນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1230 modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:385
#: modules/gui/qt/components/controller.hpp:108
#: modules/gui/qt/components/controller.hpp:118
msgid "Faster"
msgstr "ໄວຂຶ້ນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1231 src/libvlc-module.c:1237
msgid "Select the hotkey to use for fast forward playback."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນໄປໜ້າແບບໄວ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1232 modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:383
#: modules/gui/qt/components/controller.hpp:108
#: modules/gui/qt/components/controller.hpp:118
msgid "Slower"
msgstr "ຊ້າລົງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1233 src/libvlc-module.c:1239
msgid "Select the hotkey to use for slow motion playback."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນແບບຊ້າ (Slow motion)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1234
msgid "Normal rate"
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວປົກກະຕິ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1235
msgid "Select the hotkey to set the playback rate back to normal."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄວາມໄວການຫຼິ້ນໃຫ້ກັບມາເປັນປົກກະຕິ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1236 modules/gui/qt/menus.cpp:880
msgid "Faster (fine)"
msgstr "ໄວຂຶ້ນ (ລະອຽດ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1238 modules/gui/qt/menus.cpp:888
msgid "Slower (fine)"
msgstr "ຊ້າລົງ (ລະອຽດ)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1240 modules/control/hotkeys.c:410
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCControlsBarCommon.m:163
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCFSPanelController.m:112
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:388 modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:489
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:497
#: modules/gui/qt/components/controller.hpp:112
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/sout.cpp:93 modules/notify/notify.c:335
#: modules/gui/qt/ui/streampanel.h:181
msgid "Next"
msgstr "ຖັດໄປ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1241
msgid "Select the hotkey to use to skip to the next item in the playlist."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອຂ້າມໄປລາຍການຖັດໄປໃນລາຍການຫຼິ້ນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1242 modules/control/hotkeys.c:414
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCControlsBarCommon.m:160
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCFSPanelController.m:115
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:387 modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:490
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:496
#: modules/gui/qt/components/controller.hpp:112 modules/notify/notify.c:333
msgid "Previous"
msgstr "ກ່ອນໜ້າ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1243
msgid "Select the hotkey to use to skip to the previous item in the playlist."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອຍ້ອນກັບໄປລາຍການກ່ອນໜ້າໃນລາຍການຫຼິ້ນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1244 modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:378
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:488 modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainMenu.m:495
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCMainWindowControlsBar.m:61
#: modules/gui/qt/components/controller.hpp:107
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/vlm.cpp:545 modules/gui/qt/ui/streampanel.h:180
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "ຢຸດ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1245
msgid "Select the hotkey to stop playback."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອຢຸດການຫຼິ້ນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1246 modules/gui/macosx/VLCControlsBarCommon.m:75
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCFSPanelController.m:130
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCVideoEffectsWindowController.m:273
#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCVideoEffectsWindowController.m:295
#: modules/spu/marq.c:151 modules/spu/rss.c:198
#: modules/gui/qt/ui/sprefs_subtitles.h:293
#: modules/gui/qt/ui/video_effects.h:1279
msgid "Position"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1247
msgid "Select the hotkey to display the position."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອສະແດງຕຳແໜ່ງ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1249
msgid "Very short backwards jump"
msgstr "ຍ້ອນກັບໄລຍະສັ້ນຫຼາຍ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1251
msgid "Select the hotkey to make a very short backwards jump."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອຍ້ອນກັບໄປໄລຍະສັ້ນຫຼາຍ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1252
msgid "Short backwards jump"
msgstr "ຍ້ອນກັບໄລຍະສັ້ນ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1254
msgid "Select the hotkey to make a short backwards jump."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອຍ້ອນກັບໄປໄລຍະສັ້ນ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1255
msgid "Medium backwards jump"
msgstr "ຍ້ອນກັບໄລຍະປານກາງ"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1257
msgid "Select the hotkey to make a medium backwards jump."
msgstr "ເລືອກປຸ່ມລັດເພື່ອຍ້ອນກັບໄປໄລຍະປານກາງ."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1258
msgid "Long backwards jump"
