"The symbol rate must be specified manually for some systems, notably DVB-C, "
"DVB-S and DVB-S2."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸ symbol rate ເອງສຳລັບບາງລະບົບ ເຊັ່ນ DVB-C, DVB-S ແລະ DVB-S2."

