#: modules/access/rtp/rtp.c:49 modules/stream_out/rtp.c:144
msgid "SRTP key (hexadecimal)"
msgstr "ຄີ SRTP (ເລກຖານສິບຫົກ)"

#: modules/access/rtp/rtp.c:51
msgid ""
"RTP packets will be authenticated and deciphered with this Secure RTP master "
"shared secret key. This must be a 32-character-long hexadecimal string."
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກັດ RTP ຈະຖືກຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ແລະ ຖອດລະຫັດດ້ວຍຄີລັບຫຼັກ Secure RTP ນີ້. "
"ຕ້ອງເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມເລກຖານສິບຫົກທີ່ມີຄວາມຍາວ 32 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

#: modules/access/rtp/rtp.c:55 modules/stream_out/rtp.c:150
msgid "SRTP salt (hexadecimal)"
msgstr "SRTP salt (ເລກຖານສິບຫົກ)"

#: modules/access/rtp/rtp.c:57 modules/stream_out/rtp.c:152
msgid ""
"Secure RTP requires a (non-secret) master salt value. This must be a 28-"
"character-long hexadecimal string."
msgstr ""
"Secure RTP ຕ້ອງການຄ່າ master salt (ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄວາມລັບ). ຕ້ອງເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມເລກຖານສິບຫົກທີ່ມີຄວາມຍາວ 28 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

