msgstr "ຂະໜາດ GOP ສູງສຸດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:72
msgid ""
"Sets maximum interval between IDR-frames. Larger values save bits, thus "
"improving quality for a given bitrate at the cost of seeking precision. Use "
"-1 for infinite."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດລະຫວ່າງ IDR-frames. ຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຈະປະຢັດບິດ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບ ແຕ່ຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມຊັດເຈນໃນການຄົ້ນຫາ (seek). ໃຊ້ -1 ສຳລັບຄ່າບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:76
msgid "Minimum GOP size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ GOP ຕ່ຳສຸດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:77
msgid ""
"Sets minimum interval between IDR-frames. In H.264, I-frames do not "
"necessarily bound a closed GOP because it is allowable for a P-frame to be "
"predicted from more frames than just the one frame before it (also see "
"reference frame option). Therefore, I-frames are not necessarily seekable. "
"IDR-frames restrict subsequent P-frames from referring to any frame prior to "
"the IDR-frame. \n"
"If scenecuts appear within this interval, they are still encoded as I-"
"frames, but do not start a new GOP."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງໄລຍະຫ່າງຕ່ຳສຸດລະຫວ່າງ IDR-frames. ໃນ H.264, I-frames ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປິດ GOP ສະເໝີໄປ. "
"IDR-frames ຈະຈຳກັດບໍ່ໃຫ້ P-frames ຖັດໄປອ້າງອີງເຖິງເຟຣມໃດໆ ກ່ອນໜ້າ IDR-frame. \n"
"ຫາກມີການຕັດສາກ (scenecuts) ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນໄລຍະນີ້, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນ I-frames ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ເລີ່ມ GOP ໃໝ່."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:86
msgid "Use recovery points to close GOPs"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຈຸດກູ້ຄືນ (recovery points) ເພື່ອປິດ GOP"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:88
msgid ""
"none: use closed GOPs only\n"
"normal: use standard open GOPs\n"
"bluray: use Blu-ray compatible open GOPs"
msgstr ""
"none: ໃຊ້ສະເພາະ GOP ແບບປິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ\n"
"normal: ໃຊ້ GOP ແບບເປີດມາດຕະຖານ\n"
"bluray: ໃຊ້ GOP ແບບເປີດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ Blu-ray"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:92
msgid "use open GOP, for bluray compatibility use also bluray-compat option"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ GOP ແບບເປີດ, ສຳລັບຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ Blu-ray ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ bluray-compat ຮ່ວມດ້ວຍ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:95
msgid "Enable compatibility hacks for Blu-ray support"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອຮອງຮັບ Blu-ray"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:96
msgid ""
"Enable hacks for Blu-ray support, this doesn't enforce every aspect of Blu-"
"ray compatibility\n"
"e.g. resolution, framerate, level"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອຮອງຮັບ Blu-ray, ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ບັງຄັບທຸກດ້ານຂອງຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ Blu-ray\n"
"ເຊັ່ນ: ຄວາມລະອຽດ, ເຟຣມເຣດ, ລະດັບ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:99
msgid "Extra I-frames aggressivity"
msgstr "ຄວາມເຂັ້ມງວດຂອງ I-frames ເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:100
msgid ""
"Scene-cut detection. Controls how aggressively to insert extra I-frames. "
"With small values of scenecut, the codec often has to force an I-frame when "
"it would exceed keyint. Good values of scenecut may find a better location "
"for the I-frame. Large values use more I-frames than necessary, thus wasting "
"bits. -1 disables scene-cut detection, so I-frames are inserted only every "
"other keyint frames, which probably leads to ugly encoding artifacts. Range "
"1 to 100."
msgstr ""
"ການກວດຈັບການຕັດສາກ. ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມເຂັ້ມງວດໃນການແຊກ I-frames ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມຈະຊ່ວຍຫາຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ດີສຳລັບ I-frame. ຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສິ້ນເປືອງບິດ. "
"-1 ແມ່ນປິດການກວດຈັບການຕັດສາກ. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ 1 ຫາ 100."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:111
msgid "B-frames between I and P"
msgstr "B-frames ລະຫວ່າງ I ແລະ P"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:112
msgid "Number of consecutive B-frames between I and P-frames. Range 1 to 16."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ B-frames ທີ່ລຽງຕິດຕໍ່ກັນລະຫວ່າງ I ແລະ P-frames. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ 1 ຫາ 16."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:115
msgid "Adaptive B-frame decision"
msgstr "ການຕັດສິນໃຈໃຊ້ B-frame ແບບປັບຕົວ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:116
msgid ""
"Force the specified number of consecutive B-frames to be used, except "
"possibly before an I-frame. Range 0 to 2."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຈຳນວນ B-frames ທີ່ລະບຸ, ຍົກເວັ້ນກ່ອນ I-frame. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ 0 ຫາ 2."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:120
msgid "Influence (bias) B-frames usage"
msgstr "ອິດທິພົນ (bias) ໃນການໃຊ້ B-frames"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:121
msgid ""
"Bias the choice to use B-frames. Positive values cause more B-frames, "
"negative values cause less B-frames."
msgstr "ປັບແນວໂນ້ມການໃຊ້ B-frames. ຄ່າບວກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີ B-frames ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້ອຍລົງ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:125
msgid "Keep some B-frames as references"
msgstr "ເກັບ B-frames ບາງສ່ວນໄວ້ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:126
msgid ""
"Allows B-frames to be used as references for predicting other frames. Keeps "
"the middle of 2+ consecutive B-frames as a reference, and reorders frame "
"appropriately.\n"
" - none: Disabled\n"
" - strict: Strictly hierarchical pyramid\n"
" - normal: Non-strict (not Blu-ray compatible)\n"
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ B-frames ເປັນບ່ອນອ້າງອີງສຳລັບເຟຣມອື່ນໆ.\n"
" - none: ປິດໃຊ້ງານ\n"
" - strict: ໂຄງສ້າງແບບປີຣາມິດຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດ\n"
" - normal: ບໍ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ (ບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ Blu-ray)\n"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:134
msgid "Use fullrange instead of TV colorrange"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຊ່ວງສີແບບເຕັມ (fullrange) ແທນທີ່ຊ່ວງສີແບບ TV"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:135
msgid ""
"TV-range is usually used colorrange, defining this to true will enable "
"libx264 to use full colorrange on encoding"
msgstr "ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະໃຊ້ຊ່ວງສີແບບ TV, ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າຈິງ libx264 ຈະໃຊ້ຊ່ວງສີແບບເຕັມໃນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:138
msgid "CABAC"
msgstr "CABAC"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:139
msgid ""
"CABAC (Context-Adaptive Binary Arithmetic Coding). Slightly slows down "
"encoding and decoding, but should save 10 to 15% bitrate."
msgstr "CABAC. ເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຖອດລະຫັດຊ້າລົງເລັກນ້ອຍ, ແຕ່ຈະຊ່ວຍປະຢັດບິດເຣດໄດ້ 10 ຫາ 15%."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:144
msgid ""
"Number of previous frames used as predictors. This is effective in Anime, "
"but seems to make little difference in live-action source material. Some "
"decoders are unable to deal with large frameref values. Range 1 to 16."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນເຟຣມກ່ອນໜ້າທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄາດຄະເນ. ໄດ້ຜົນດີໃນ Anime. ຕົວຖອດລະຫັດບາງຕົວບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດການກັບຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປໄດ້. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ 1 ຫາ 16."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:149
msgid "Skip loop filter"
msgstr "ຂ້າມຕົວກອງລູບ (loop filter)"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:150
msgid "Deactivate the deblocking loop filter (decreases quality)."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕົວກອງລູບແບບ deblocking (ຈະຫຼຸດຄຸນນະພາບລົງ)."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:152
msgid "Loop filter AlphaC0 and Beta parameters alpha:beta"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ AlphaC0 ແລະ Beta ຂອງຕົວກອງລູບ alpha:beta"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:153
msgid ""
"Loop filter AlphaC0 and Beta parameters. Range -6 to 6 for both alpha and "
"beta parameters. -6 means light filter, 6 means strong."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງຕົວກອງລູບ. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ -6 ຫາ 6. -6 ໝາຍເຖິງການກອງເບົາໆ, 6 ໝາຍເຖິງການກອງແບບເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:157
msgid "H.264 level"
msgstr "ລະດັບ H.264"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:158
msgid ""
"Specify H.264 level (as defined by Annex A of the standard). Levels are not "
"enforced; it's up to the user to select a level compatible with the rest of "
"the encoding options. Range 1 to 5.1 (10 to 51 is also allowed). Set to 0 "
"for letting x264 set level."
msgstr "ລະບຸລະດັບ H.264. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ 1 ຫາ 5.1. ຕັ້ງເປັນ 0 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ x264 ກຳນົດລະດັບໃຫ້ເອງ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:163
msgid "H.264 profile"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ H.264"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:164
msgid "Specify H.264 profile which limits are enforced over other settings"
msgstr "ລະບຸໂປຣໄຟລ໌ H.264 ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດເໜືອກວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:170
msgid "Interlaced mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດແຊກເສັ້ນ (Interlaced)"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:171
msgid "Pure-interlaced mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດແຊກເສັ້ນແບບບໍລິສຸດ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:173
msgid "Frame packing"
msgstr "ການຈັດລຽງເຟຣມ (Frame packing)"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:174
msgid ""
"For stereoscopic videos define frame arrangement:\n"
" 0: checkerboard - pixels are alternatively from L and R\n"
" 1: column alternation - L and R are interlaced by column\n"
" 2: row alternation - L and R are interlaced by row\n"
" 3: side by side - L is on the left, R on the right\n"
" 4: top bottom - L is on top, R on bottom\n"
" 5: frame alternation - one view per frame"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບວິດີໂອແບບ 3D (stereoscopic) ກຳນົດການຈັດລຽງເຟຣມ:\n"
" 0: checkerboard - ພິກເຊວສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ\n"
" 1: column alternation - ຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ ສະຫຼັບກັນຕາມຖັນ\n"
" 2: row alternation - ຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ ສະຫຼັບກັນຕາມແຖວ\n"
" 3: side by side - ຊ້າຍຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ຂວາຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາ\n"
" 4: top bottom - ຊ້າຍຢູ່ເທິງ, ຂວາຢູ່ລຸ່ມ\n"
" 5: frame alternation - ໜຶ່ງມຸມເບິ່ງຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງເຟຣມ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:182
msgid "Use Periodic Intra Refresh"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຣີເຟຣຊພາຍໃນແບບເປັນໄລຍະ (Periodic Intra Refresh)"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:183
msgid "Use Periodic Intra Refresh instead of IDR frames"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຣີເຟຣຊພາຍໃນແບບເປັນໄລຍະ ແທນທີ່ IDR frames"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:185
msgid "Use mb-tree ratecontrol"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຄວບຄຸມອັດຕາແບບ mb-tree"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:186
msgid "You can disable use of Macroblock-tree on ratecontrol"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ Macroblock-tree ໃນການຄວບຄຸມອັດຕາບິດໄດ້"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:188
msgid "Force number of slices per frame"
msgstr "ບັງຄັບຈຳນວນຊິ້ນສ່ວນ (slices) ຕໍ່ເຟຣມ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:189
msgid "Force rectangular slices and is overridden by other slicing options"
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊິ້ນສ່ວນແບບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ ແລະ ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກການແບ່ງຊິ້ນສ່ວນອື່ນໆ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:191
msgid "Limit the size of each slice in bytes"
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະຊິ້ນສ່ວນເປັນໄບຕ໌"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:192
msgid "Sets a maximum slice size in bytes, Includes NAL overhead in size"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຂະໜາດຊິ້ນສ່ວນສູງສຸດເປັນໄບຕ໌, ລວມທັງ NAL overhead"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:194
msgid "Limit the size of each slice in macroblocks"
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະຊິ້ນສ່ວນເປັນ macroblocks"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:195
msgid "Sets a maximum number of macroblocks per slice"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຈຳນວນ macroblocks ສູງສຸດຕໍ່ຊິ້ນສ່ວນ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:198
msgid "Set QP"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ QP"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:199
msgid ""
"This selects the quantizer to use. Lower values result in better fidelity, "
"but higher bitrates. 26 is a good default value. Range 0 (lossless) to 51."
msgstr "ເລືອກຄ່າ quantizer ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມຄົມຊັດທີ່ດີກວ່າ ແຕ່ບິດເຣດຈະສູງຂຶ້ນ. 26 ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ດີ. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ 0 ຫາ 51."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:203
msgid "Quality-based VBR"
msgstr "VBR ຕາມຄຸນນະພາບ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:204
msgid "1-pass Quality-based VBR. Range 0 to 51."
msgstr "VBR ຕາມຄຸນນະພາບແບບ 1-pass. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ 0 ຫາ 51."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:206
msgid "Min QP"
msgstr "QP ຕ່ຳສຸດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:207
msgid "Minimum quantizer parameter. 15 to 35 seems to be a useful range."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ quantizer ຕ່ຳສຸດ. ຊ່ວງ 15 ຫາ 35 ແມ່ນຊ່ວງທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:210
msgid "Max QP"
msgstr "QP ສູງສຸດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:211
msgid "Maximum quantizer parameter."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ quantizer ສູງສຸດ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:213
msgid "Max QP step"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ QP ສູງສຸດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:214
msgid "Max QP step between frames."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນ QP ສູງສຸດລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:216
msgid "Average bitrate tolerance"
msgstr "ຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນຂອງບິດເຣດສະເລ່ຍ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:217
msgid "Allowed variance in average bitrate (in kbits/s)."
msgstr "ຄວາມຜັນຜວນທີ່ຍອມຮັບໄດ້ໃນບິດເຣດສະເລ່ຍ (ເປັນ kbits/s)."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:220
msgid "Max local bitrate"
msgstr "ບິດເຣດທ້ອງຖິ່ນສູງສຸດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:221
msgid "Sets a maximum local bitrate (in kbits/s)."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງບິດເຣດທ້ອງຖິ່ນສູງສຸດ (ເປັນ kbits/s)."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:223
msgid "VBV buffer"
msgstr "ບັບເຟີ VBV"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:224
msgid "Averaging period for the maximum local bitrate (in kbits)."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາສະເລ່ຍສຳລັບບິດເຣດທ້ອງຖິ່ນສູງສຸດ (ເປັນ kbits)."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:227
msgid "Initial VBV buffer occupancy"
msgstr "ການຄອບຄອງບັບເຟີ VBV ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:228
msgid ""
"Sets the initial buffer occupancy as a fraction of the buffer size. Range "
"0.0 to 1.0."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄອບຄອງບັບເຟີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຂະໜາດບັບເຟີ. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:231
msgid "How AQ distributes bits"
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ AQ ກະຈາຍບິດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:232
msgid ""
"Defines bitdistribution mode for AQ, default 1\n"
" - 0: Disabled\n"
" - 1: Current x264 default mode\n"
" - 2: uses log(var)^2 instead of log(var) and attempts to adapt strength per "
"frame"
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໂໝດການກະຈາຍບິດສຳລັບ AQ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1\n"
" - 0: ປິດໃຊ້ງານ\n"
" - 1: ໂໝດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ x264 ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ\n"
" - 2: ໃຊ້ log(var)^2 ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມປັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຕາມແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:237
msgid "Strength of AQ"
msgstr "ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງ AQ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:238
msgid ""
"Strength to reduce blocking and blurring in flat\n"
"and textured areas, default 1.0 recommended to be between 0..2\n"
" - 0.5: weak AQ\n"
" - 1.5: strong AQ"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມໃນການຫຼຸດພາບແຕກເປັນບລັອກ ແລະ ພາບມົວ.\n"
" - 0.5: AQ ແບບເບົາ\n"
" - 1.5: AQ ແບບເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:244
msgid "QP factor between I and P"
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນ QP ລະຫວ່າງ I ແລະ P"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:245
msgid "QP factor between I and P. Range 1.0 to 2.0."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນ QP ລະຫວ່າງ I ແລະ P. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ 1.0 ຫາ 2.0."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:248
msgid "QP factor between P and B"
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນ QP ລະຫວ່າງ P ແລະ B"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:249
msgid "QP factor between P and B. Range 1.0 to 2.0."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນ QP ລະຫວ່າງ P ແລະ B. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ 1.0 ຫາ 2.0."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:251
msgid "QP difference between chroma and luma"
msgstr "ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງ QP ລະຫວ່າງສີ (chroma) ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luma)"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:252
msgid "QP difference between chroma and luma."
msgstr "ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງ QP ລະຫວ່າງສີ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:254
msgid "Multipass ratecontrol"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມອັດຕາບິດແບບຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ (Multipass)"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:255
msgid ""
"Multipass ratecontrol:\n"
" - 1: First pass, creates stats file\n"
" - 2: Last pass, does not overwrite stats file\n"
" - 3: Nth pass, overwrites stats file\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຄວບຄຸມອັດຕາແບບ Multipass:\n"
" - 1: ຮອບທຳອິດ, ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ສະຖິຕິ\n"
" - 2: ຮອບສຸດທ້າຍ, ບໍ່ຂຽນທັບໄຟລ໌ສະຖິຕິ\n"
" - 3: ຮອບທີ N, ຂຽນທັບໄຟລ໌ສະຖິຕິ\n"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:260
msgid "QP curve compression"
msgstr "ການບີບອັດເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ QP"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:261
msgid "QP curve compression. Range 0.0 (CBR) to 1.0 (QCP)."
msgstr "ການບີບອັດເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ QP. ໄລຍະແມ່ນ 0.0 (CBR) ຫາ 1.0 (QCP)."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:263 modules/codec/x264.c:267
msgid "Reduce fluctuations in QP"
msgstr "ຫຼຸດການຜັນຜວນໃນ QP"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:264
msgid ""
"This reduces the fluctuations in QP before curve compression. Temporally "
"blurs complexity."
msgstr "ຫຼຸດການຜັນຜວນໃນ QP ກ່ອນການບີບອັດເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:268
msgid ""
"This reduces the fluctuations in QP after curve compression. Temporally "
"blurs quants."
msgstr "ຫຼຸດການຜັນຜວນໃນ QP ຫຼັງການບີບອັດເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:273
msgid "Partitions to consider"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ (Partitions) ທີ່ຈະພິຈາລະນາ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:274
msgid ""
"Partitions to consider in analyse mode:\n"
" - none  : \n"
" - fast  : i4x4\n"
" - normal: i4x4,p8x8,(i8x8)\n"
" - slow  : i4x4,p8x8,(i8x8),b8x8\n"
" - all   : i4x4,p8x8,(i8x8),b8x8,p4x4\n"
"(p4x4 requires p8x8. i8x8 requires 8x8dct)."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຍ່ອຍທີ່ຈະພິຈາລະນາໃນໂໝດການວິເຄາະ:\n"
" - none  : ບໍ່ມີ\n"
" - fast  : i4x4\n"
" - normal: i4x4, p8x8, (i8x8)\n"
" - slow  : i4x4, p8x8, (i8x8), b8x8\n"
" - all   : ທັງໝົດ\n"
"(p4x4 ຕ້ອງການ p8x8, i8x8 ຕ້ອງການ 8x8dct)."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:282
msgid "Direct MV prediction mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຄາດຄະເນ MV ໂດຍກົງ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:285
msgid "Direct prediction size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດການຄາດຄະເນໂດຍກົງ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:286
msgid ""
"Direct prediction size:\n"
" -  0: 4x4\n"
" -  1: 8x8\n"
" - -1: smallest possible according to level\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດການຄາດຄະເນໂດຍກົງ:\n"
" -  0: 4x4\n"
" -  1: 8x8\n"
" - -1: ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ຕາມລະດັບ\n"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:291
msgid "Weighted prediction for B-frames"
msgstr "ການຄາດຄະເນແບບຖ່ວງນ້ຳໜັກສຳລັບ B-frames"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:292
msgid "Weighted prediction for B-frames."
msgstr "ການຄາດຄະເນແບບຖ່ວງນ້ຳໜັກສຳລັບ B-frames."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:294
msgid "Weighted prediction for P-frames"
msgstr "ການຄາດຄະເນແບບຖ່ວງນ້ຳໜັກສຳລັບ P-frames"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:295
msgid ""
"Weighted prediction for P-frames:\n"
" - 0: Disabled\n"
" - 1: Blind offset\n"
" - 2: Smart analysis\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຄາດຄະເນແບບຖ່ວງນ້ຳໜັກສຳລັບ P-frames:\n"
" - 0: ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ\n"
" - 1: Blind offset\n"
" - 2: ການວິເຄາະແບບສະຫຼາດ\n"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:300
msgid "Integer pixel motion estimation method"
msgstr "ວິທີການປະເມີນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວພິກເຊວແບບຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:301
msgid ""
"Selects the motion estimation algorithm:\n"
" - dia: diamond search, radius 1 (fast)\n"
" - hex: hexagonal search, radius 2\n"
" - umh: uneven multi-hexagon search (better but slower)\n"
" - esa: exhaustive search (extremely slow, primarily for testing)\n"
" - tesa: hadamard exhaustive search (extremely slow, primarily for testing)\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຂັ້ນຕອນການປະເມີນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ:\n"
" - dia: ການຄົ້ນຫາແບບເພັດ, ລັດສະໝີ 1 (ໄວ)\n"
" - hex: ການຄົ້ນຫາແບບຫົກຫຼ່ຽມ, ລັດສະໝີ 2\n"
" - umh: ການຄົ້ນຫາແບບຫຼາຍຫົກຫຼ່ຽມບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ (ດີກວ່າແຕ່ຊ້າກວ່າ)\n"
" - esa: ການຄົ້ນຫາແບບລະອຽດທຸກຈຸດ (ຊ້າຫຼາຍ, ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການທົດສອບເປັນຫຼັກ)\n"
" - tesa: ການຄົ້ນຫາແບບ hadamard ລະອຽດທຸກຈຸດ (ຊ້າຫຼາຍ, ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການທົດສອບເປັນຫຼັກ)\n"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:308
msgid "Maximum motion vector search range"
msgstr "ໄລຍະການຄົ້ນຫາ motion vector ສູງສຸດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:309
msgid ""
"Maximum distance to search for motion estimation, measured from predicted "
"position(s). Default of 16 is good for most footage, high motion sequences "
"may benefit from settings between 24 and 32. Range 0 to 64."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງສູງສຸດໃນການຄົ້ນຫາເພື່ອປະເມີນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ, ວັດແທກຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຄາດຄະເນໄວ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 16 ເຊິ່ງເໝາະສົມກັບວິດີໂອສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ວິດີໂອທີ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວສູງອາດຈະໄດ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 24 ຫາ 32. ຊ່ວງຄ່າແມ່ນ 0 ຫາ 64."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:314
msgid "Maximum motion vector length"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວ motion vector ສູງສຸດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:315
msgid ""
"Maximum motion vector length in pixels. -1 is automatic, based on level."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຍາວ motion vector ສູງສຸດເປັນພິກເຊວ. -1 ແມ່ນອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ອີງຕາມລະດັບ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:318
msgid "Minimum buffer space between threads"
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ບັບເຟີຂັ້ນຕ່ຳລະຫວ່າງເທຣດ (threads)"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:319
msgid ""
"Minimum buffer space between threads. -1 is automatic, based on number of "
"threads."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນທີ່ບັບເຟີຂັ້ນຕ່ຳລະຫວ່າງເທຣດ. -1 ແມ່ນອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ອີງຕາມຈຳນວນເທຣດ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:322
msgid "Strength of psychovisual optimization, default is \"1.0:0.0\""
msgstr "ຄວາມແຮງຂອງການປັບແຕ່ງທາງຈິດຕະພາບ (psychovisual), ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ \"1.0:0.0\""

#: modules/codec/x264.c:323
msgid ""
"First parameter controls if RD is on (subme>=6) or off.\n"
"Second parameter controls if Trellis is used on psychovisual optimization, "
"default off"
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີທຳອິດຄວບຄຸມວ່າຈະເປີດ RD (subme>=6) ຫຼື ບໍ່.\n"
"ພາຣາມິເຕີທີສອງຄວບຄຸມວ່າຈະໃຊ້ Trellis ໃນການປັບແຕ່ງທາງຈິດຕະພາບຫຼືບໍ່, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນປິດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:327
msgid "Subpixel motion estimation and partition decision quality"
msgstr "ການປະເມີນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວລະດັບຊັບພິກເຊວ ແລະ ຄຸນນະພາບການຕັດສິນໃຈແບ່ງສ່ວນ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:329
msgid ""
"This parameter controls quality versus speed tradeoffs involved in the "
"motion estimation decision process (lower = quicker and higher = better "
"quality). Range 1 to 9."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ຄວບຄຸມການແລກປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງຄຸນນະພາບກັບຄວາມໄວໃນຂະບວນການຕັດສິນໃຈປະເມີນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (ຄ່ານ້ອຍ = ໄວກວ່າ ແລະ ຄ່າສູງ = ຄຸນນະພາບດີກວ່າ). ຊ່ວງຄ່າແມ່ນ 1 ຫາ 9."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:333
msgid "RD based mode decision for B-frames. This requires subme 6 (or higher)."
msgstr "ການຕັດສິນໃຈໂໝດໂດຍອີງຕາມ RD ສຳລັບ B-frames. ອັນນີ້ຕ້ອງການ subme 6 (ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າ)."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:336
msgid "Decide references on a per partition basis"
msgstr "ຕັດສິນໃຈການອ້າງອີງໂດຍອີງຕາມແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ (partition)"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:337
msgid ""
"Allows each 8x8 or 16x8 partition to independently select a reference frame, "
"as opposed to only one ref per macroblock."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ 8x8 ຫຼື 16x8 ເລືອກເຟຣມອ້າງອີງໄດ້ຢ່າງເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ, ແທນທີ່ຈະມີການອ້າງອີງພຽງອັນດຽວຕໍ່ແມັກໂຄຣບັອກ (macroblock)."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:341
msgid "Chroma in motion estimation"
msgstr "ຄຣໍມາ (Chroma) ໃນການປະເມີນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:342
msgid "Chroma ME for subpel and mode decision in P-frames."
msgstr "Chroma ME ສຳລັບ subpel ແລະ ການຕັດສິນໃຈໂໝດໃນ P-frames."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:345
msgid "Joint bidirectional motion refinement."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວແບບສອງທິດທາງຮ່ວມກັນ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:347
msgid "Adaptive spatial transform size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດການແປງທາງພື້ນທີ່ແບບປັບຕົວ (Adaptive spatial transform)"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:349
msgid "SATD-based decision for 8x8 transform in inter-MBs."
msgstr "ການຕັດສິນໃຈໂດຍອີງຕາມ SATD ສຳລັບການແປງ 8x8 ໃນ inter-MBs."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:351
msgid "Trellis RD quantization"
msgstr "ການຄວນໄທເຊຊັນ (quantization) Trellis RD"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:352
msgid ""
"Trellis RD quantization:\n"
" - 0: disabled\n"
" - 1: enabled only on the final encode of a MB\n"
" - 2: enabled on all mode decisions\n"
"This requires CABAC."
msgstr ""
"ການຄວນໄທເຊຊັນ Trellis RD:\n"
" - 0: ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ\n"
" - 1: ເປີດໃຊ້ສະເພາະການເຂົ້າລະຫັດສຸດທ້າຍຂອງ MB ເທົ່ານັ້ນ\n"
" - 2: ເປີດໃຊ້ໃນທຸກການຕັດສິນໃຈໂໝດ\n"
"ອັນນີ້ຕ້ອງການ CABAC."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:358
msgid "Early SKIP detection on P-frames"
msgstr "ການກວດຫາການ SKIP ລ່ວງໜ້າໃນ P-frames"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:359
msgid "Early SKIP detection on P-frames."
msgstr "ການກວດຫາການ SKIP ລ່ວງໜ້າໃນ P-frames."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:361
msgid "Coefficient thresholding on P-frames"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເກນສຳປະສິດ (Coefficient) ໃນ P-frames"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:362
msgid ""
"Coefficient thresholding on P-frames. Eliminate dct blocks containing only a "
"small single coefficient."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດເກນສຳປະສິດໃນ P-frames. ກຳຈັດ dct blocks ທີ່ມີພຽງແຕ່ສຳປະສິດດ່ຽວນ້ອຍໆ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:365
msgid "Use Psy-optimizations"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການປັບແຕ່ງແບບ Psy"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:366
msgid "Use all visual optimizations that can worsen both PSNR and SSIM"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການປັບແຕ່ງທາງສາຍຕາທັງໝົດທີ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ທັງ PSNR ແລະ SSIM ຫຼຸດລົງ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:370
msgid ""
"Dct-domain noise reduction. Adaptive pseudo-deadzone. 10 to 1000 seems to be "
"a useful range."
msgstr ""
"ການຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບໃນ Dct-domain. Adaptive pseudo-deadzone. ຊ່ວງຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມແມ່ນ 10 ຫາ 1000."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:373
msgid "Inter luma quantization deadzone"
msgstr "Inter luma quantization deadzone"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:374
msgid "Set the size of the inter luma quantization deadzone. Range 0 to 32."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂະໜາດຂອງ inter luma quantization deadzone. ຊ່ວງຄ່າແມ່ນ 0 ຫາ 32."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:377
msgid "Intra luma quantization deadzone"
msgstr "Intra luma quantization deadzone"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:378
msgid "Set the size of the intra luma quantization deadzone. Range 0 to 32."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂະໜາດຂອງ intra luma quantization deadzone. ຊ່ວງຄ່າແມ່ນ 0 ຫາ 32."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:383
msgid "Non-deterministic optimizations when threaded"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງແບບບໍ່ກຳນົດແນ່ນອນ (Non-deterministic) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເທຣດ"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:384
msgid "Slightly improve quality of SMP, at the cost of repeatability."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບຂອງ SMP ເລັກນ້ອຍ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກກັບຄວາມສາມາດໃນການເຮັດຊ້ຳ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:387
msgid "CPU optimizations"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ CPU"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:388
msgid "Use assembler CPU optimizations."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການປັບແຕ່ງ CPU ແບບ assembler."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:390
msgid "Filename for 2 pass stats file"
msgstr "ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບເກັບສະຖິຕິການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ 2 pass"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:391
msgid "Filename for 2 pass stats file for multi-pass encoding."
msgstr "ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບເກັບສະຖິຕິ 2 pass ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບຫຼາຍ pass."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:393
msgid "PSNR computation"
msgstr "ການຄິດໄລ່ PSNR"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:394
msgid ""
"Compute and print PSNR stats. This has no effect on the actual encoding "
"quality."
msgstr ""
"ຄິດໄລ່ ແລະ ສະແດງສະຖິຕິ PSNR. ອັນນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄຸນນະພາບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຕົວຈິງ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:397
msgid "SSIM computation"
msgstr "ການຄິດໄລ່ SSIM"

#: modules/codec/x264.c:398
msgid ""
"Compute and print SSIM stats. This has no effect on the actual encoding "
"quality."
msgstr ""
"ຄິດໄລ່ ແລະ ສະແດງສະຖິຕິ SSIM. ອັນນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄຸນນະພາບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຕົວຈິງ."

#: modules/codec/x264.c:401
msgid "Quiet mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດງຽບ"

