#: modules/control/ntservice.c:54
msgid "Configuration options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#: modules/control/ntservice.c:56
msgid ""
"Configuration options that will be used by the Service (eg. --foo=bar --no-"
"foobar). It should be specified at install time so the Service is properly "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂດຍ Service (ເຊັ່ນ --foo=bar --no-foobar). ຄວນລະບຸໃນເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ Service ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: modules/control/ntservice.c:61
msgid ""
"Additional interfaces spawned by the Service. It should be specified at "
"install time so the Service is properly configured. Use a comma separated "
"list of interface modules. (common values are: logger, sap, rc, http)"
msgstr ""
"ອິນເຕີເຟດເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ Service. ຄວນລະບຸໃນເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ Service ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃຊ້ຈຸດ (,) ຂັ້ນລາຍຊື່ອິນເຕີເຟດ. (ຄ່າທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນ: logger, sap, rc, http)"

