msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແກນ X ຈາກຂອບຈໍດ້ານຊ້າຍ."

#: modules/spu/marq.c:98 modules/spu/rss.c:142
#: modules/stream_out/mosaic_bridge.c:132
#: share/lua/http/dialogs/mosaic_window.html:118
msgid "Y offset"
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແກນ Y"

#: modules/spu/marq.c:99 modules/spu/rss.c:143
msgid "Y offset, down from the top."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແກນ Y ຈາກດ້ານເທິງລົງມາ."

#: modules/spu/marq.c:100
msgid "Timeout"
msgstr "ໝົດເວລາ"

#: modules/spu/marq.c:101
msgid ""
"Number of milliseconds the marquee must remain displayed. Default value is 0 "
"(remains forever)."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນມິນລິວິນາທີທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມແລ່ນຈະສະແດງຄ້າງໄວ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0 (ສະແດງຕະຫຼອດໄປ)."

#: modules/spu/marq.c:104
msgid "Refresh period in ms"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາໂຫຼດໃໝ່ເປັນ ms"

#: modules/spu/marq.c:105
msgid ""
"Number of milliseconds between string updates. This is mainly useful when "
"using meta data or time format string sequences."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນມິນລິວິນາທີລະຫວ່າງການອັບເດດຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ ຫຼື ຮູບແບບເວລາ."

#: modules/spu/marq.c:109
msgid ""
"Opacity (inverse of transparency) of overlayed text. 0 = transparent, 255 = "
"totally opaque."
msgstr "ຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຊ້ອນ. 0 = ໂປ່ງໃສ, 255 = ທຶບແສງທັງໝົດ."

#: modules/spu/marq.c:111 modules/spu/rss.c:148
msgid "Font size, pixels"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຕົວອັກສອນ, ພິກເຊວ"

#: modules/spu/marq.c:112 modules/spu/rss.c:149
msgid "Font size, in pixels. Default is 0 (use default font size)."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຕົວອັກສອນເປັນພິກເຊວ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0 (ໃຊ້ຂະໜາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

#: modules/spu/marq.c:116 modules/spu/rss.c:153
msgid ""
"Color of the text that will be rendered on the video. This must be an "
"hexadecimal (like HTML colors). The first two chars are for red, then green, "
"then blue. #000000 = black, #FF0000 = red, #00FF00 = green, #FFFF00 = yellow "
"(red + green), #FFFFFF = white"
msgstr "ສີຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງເທິງວິດີໂອ. ຕ້ອງເປັນເລກຖານສິບຫົກ (ຄືກັບສີ HTML). ສອງຕົວທຳອິດແມ່ນສີແດງ, ຕາມດ້ວຍສີຂຽວ, ແລະ ສີຟ້າ. #000000 = ດຳ, #FF0000 = ແດງ, #00FF00 = ຂຽວ, #FFFF00 = ເຫຼືອງ, #FFFFFF = ຂາວ"

#: modules/spu/marq.c:121
msgid "Marquee position"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມແລ່ນ"

#: modules/spu/marq.c:123
msgid ""
"You can enforce the marquee position on the video (0=center, 1=left, "
"2=right, 4=top, 8=bottom, you can also use combinations of these values, eg "
"6 = top-right)."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດບັງຄັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມແລ່ນເທິງວິດີໂອ (0=ກາງ, 1=ຊ້າຍ, 2=ຂວາ, 4=ເທິງ, 8=ລຸ່ມ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າປະສົມໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ 6 = ເທິງ-ຂວາ)."

#: modules/spu/marq.c:134
msgid "Display text above the video"
msgstr "ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມເທິງວິດີໂອ"

#: modules/spu/marq.c:141
msgid "Marquee"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມແລ່ນ"

#: modules/spu/marq.c:142
msgid "Marquee display"
msgstr "ການສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມແລ່ນ"

#: modules/spu/marq.c:168 modules/spu/rss.c:214
msgid "Misc"
msgstr "ອື່ນໆ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:89
msgid ""
"Transparency of the mosaic foreground pictures. 0 means transparent, 255 "
"opaque (default)."
msgstr "ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງຮູບພາບພື້ນໜ້າໂມເສກ. 0 ໝາຍເຖິງໂປ່ງໃສ, 255 ໝາຍເຖິງທຶບແສງ (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:93
msgid "Total height of the mosaic, in pixels."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງທັງໝົດຂອງໂມເສກ ເປັນພິກເຊວ."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:95
msgid "Total width of the mosaic, in pixels."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງທັງໝົດຂອງໂມເສກ ເປັນພິກເຊວ."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:97
msgid "Top left corner X coordinate"
msgstr "ພິກັດ X ຂອງມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:99
msgid "X Coordinate of the top-left corner of the mosaic."
msgstr "ພິກັດ X ຂອງມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງໂມເສກ."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:100
msgid "Top left corner Y coordinate"
msgstr "ພິກັດ Y ຂອງມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:102
msgid "Y Coordinate of the top-left corner of the mosaic."
msgstr "ພິກັດ Y ຂອງມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງໂມເສກ."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:104
msgid "Border width"
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຂອບ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:106
msgid "Width in pixels of the border between miniatures."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງເປັນພິກເຊວຂອງຂອບລະຫວ່າງຮູບນ້ອຍ."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:107
msgid "Border height"
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງຂອງຂອບ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:109
msgid "Height in pixels of the border between miniatures."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງເປັນພິກເຊວຂອງຂອບລະຫວ່າງຮູບນ້ອຍ."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:111
msgid "Mosaic alignment"
msgstr "ການຈັດວາງໂມເສກ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:113
msgid ""
"You can enforce the mosaic alignment on the video (0=center, 1=left, "
"2=right, 4=top, 8=bottom, you can also use combinations of these values, eg "
"6 = top-right)."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດບັງຄັບການຈັດວາງໂມເສກເທິງວິດີໂອ (0=ກາງ, 1=ຊ້າຍ, 2=ຂວາ, 4=ເທິງ, 8=ລຸ່ມ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າປະສົມໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ 6 = ເທິງ-ຂວາ)."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:117
msgid "Positioning method"
msgstr "ວິທີການກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:119
msgid ""
"Positioning method for the mosaic. auto: automatically choose the best "
"number of rows and columns. fixed: use the user-defined number of rows and "
"columns. offsets: use the user-defined offsets for each image."
msgstr "ວິທີກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງໂມເສກ. auto: ເລືອກຈຳນວນແຖວ ແລະ ຖັນທີ່ເໝາະສົມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. fixed: ໃຊ້ຈຳນວນແຖວ ແລະ ຖັນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດ. offsets: ໃຊ້ໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຮູບ."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:124 modules/video_splitter/panoramix.c:64
#: modules/video_splitter/wall.c:50
msgid "Number of rows"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:126
msgid ""
"Number of image rows in the mosaic (only used if positioning method is set "
"to \"fixed\")."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວຂອງຮູບໃນໂມເສກ (ໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອຕັ້ງວິທີກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງເປັນ \"fixed\")."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:129 modules/video_splitter/panoramix.c:60
#: modules/video_splitter/wall.c:46
msgid "Number of columns"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຖັນ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:131
msgid ""
"Number of image columns in the mosaic (only used if positioning method is "
"set to \"fixed\")."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຖັນຂອງຮູບໃນໂມເສກ (ໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອຕັ້ງວິທີກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງເປັນ \"fixed\")."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:134
msgid "Keep aspect ratio"
msgstr "ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:136
msgid "Keep the original aspect ratio when resizing mosaic elements."
msgstr "ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບເດີມເມື່ອປັບຂະໜາດອົງປະກອບໂມເສກ."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:138
msgid "Keep original size"
msgstr "ຮັກສາຂະໜາດເດີມ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:140
msgid "Keep the original size of mosaic elements."
msgstr "ຮັກສາຂະໜາດເດີມຂອງອົງປະກອບໂມເສກ."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:142
msgid "Elements order"
msgstr "ລຳດັບອົງປະກອບ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:144
msgid ""
"You can enforce the order of the elements on the mosaic. You must give a "
"comma-separated list of picture ID(s). These IDs are assigned in the "
"\"mosaic-bridge\" module."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດບັງຄັບລຳດັບອົງປະກອບໃນໂມເສກ. ຕ້ອງໃສ່ລາຍການ ID ຂອງຮູບໂດຍຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ID ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໃນໂມດູນ \"mosaic-bridge\"."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:148
msgid "Offsets in order"
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕາມລຳດັບ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:150
msgid ""
"You can enforce the (x,y) offsets of the elements on the mosaic (only used "
"if positioning method is set to \"offsets\"). You must give a comma-"
"separated list of coordinates (eg: 10,10,150,10)."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດບັງຄັບໄລຍະຫ່າງ (x,y) ຂອງອົງປະກອບໃນໂມເສກ (ໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອຕັ້ງວິທີເປັນ \"offsets\"). ຕ້ອງໃສ່ລາຍການພິກັດຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ (ເຊັ່ນ: 10,10,150,10)."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:156
msgid ""
"Pictures coming from the mosaic elements will be delayed according to this "
"value (in milliseconds). For high values you will need to raise caching at "
"input."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບທີ່ມາຈາກອົງປະກອບໂມເສກຈະຖືກໜ່ວງເວລາຕາມຄ່ານີ້ (ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ). ຖ້າຄ່າສູງ ເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງເພີ່ມການແຄຊຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ."

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:166
msgid "auto"
msgstr "ອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:166
msgid "fixed"
msgstr "ຄົງທີ່"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:166
msgid "offsets"
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:176
msgid "Mosaic video sub source"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຍ່ອຍວິດີໂອໂມເສກ"

#: modules/spu/mosaic.c:177
msgid "Mosaic"
msgstr "ໂມເສກ"

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:71
msgid "VNC Host"
msgstr "ໂຮສ VNC"

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:73
msgid "VNC hostname or IP address."
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຮສ ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງ VNC."

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:75
msgid "VNC Port"
msgstr "ພອດ VNC"

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:77
msgid "VNC port number."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລກພອດ VNC."

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:79
msgid "VNC Password"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານ VNC"

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:81
msgid "VNC password."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານ VNC."

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:83
msgid "VNC poll interval"
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງການກວດສອບ VNC"

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:85
msgid "In this interval an update from VNC is requested, default every 300 ms."
msgstr "ໃນໄລຍະເວລານີ້ ຈະມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການອັບເດດຈາກ VNC, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນທຸກໆ 300 ms."

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:87
msgid "VNC polling"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ VNC"

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:89
msgid "Activate VNC polling. Do NOT activate for use as VDR ffnetdev client."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບ VNC. ຫ້າມເປີດໃຊ້ຖ້າໃຊ້ເປັນລູກຂ່າຍ VDR ffnetdev."

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:93
msgid ""
"Send mouse events to VNC host. Not needed for use as VDR ffnetdev client."
msgstr "ສົ່ງເຫດການເມົ້າໄປຍັງໂຮສ VNC. ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຖ້າໃຊ້ເປັນລູກຂ່າຍ VDR ffnetdev."

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:95
msgid "Key events"
msgstr "ເຫດການຄີບອດ"

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:97
msgid "Send key events to VNC host."
msgstr "ສົ່ງເຫດການຄີບອດໄປຍັງໂຮສ VNC."

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:99
msgid "Alpha transparency value (default 255)"
msgstr "ຄ່າຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສອັລຟາ (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 255)"

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:101
msgid ""
"The transparency of the OSD VNC can be changed by giving a value between 0 "
"and 255. A lower value specifies more transparency a higher means less "
"transparency. The default is being not transparent (value 255) the minimum "
"is fully transparent (value 0)."
msgstr "ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງ OSD VNC ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍໃສ່ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 255. ຄ່າຍິ່ງໜ້ອຍຍິ່ງໂປ່ງໃສ, ຄ່າຍິ່ງຫຼາຍຍິ່ງທຶບແສງ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນບໍ່ໂປ່ງໃສ (255) ແລະ ຕ່ຳສຸດແມ່ນໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດ (0)."

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:116
msgid "Remote-OSD over VNC"
msgstr "Remote-OSD ຜ່ານ VNC"

#: modules/spu/remoteosd.c:118
msgid "Remote-OSD"
msgstr "Remote-OSD"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:127
msgid "Feed URLs"
msgstr "URL ຂອງຟີດ"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:128
msgid "RSS/Atom feed '|' (pipe) separated URLs."
msgstr "URL ຂອງຟີດ RSS/Atom ແຍກດ້ວຍ '|' (pipe)."

#: modules/spu/rss.c:129
msgid "Speed of feeds"
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວຂອງຟີດ"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:130
msgid "Speed of the RSS/Atom feeds in microseconds (bigger is slower)."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວຂອງຟີດ RSS/Atom ເປັນໄມໂຄຣວິນາທີ (ຄ່າຍິ່ງຫຼາຍຍິ່ງຊ້າ)."

#: modules/spu/rss.c:131
msgid "Max length"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວສູງສຸດ"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:132
msgid "Maximum number of characters displayed on the screen."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສະແດງເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: modules/spu/rss.c:134
msgid "Refresh time"
msgstr "ເວລາໂຫຼດໃໝ່"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:135
msgid ""
"Number of seconds between each forced refresh of the feeds. 0 means that the "
"feeds are never updated."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນວິນາທີລະຫວ່າງການບັງຄັບໂຫຼດຟີດໃໝ່. 0 ໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ມີການອັບເດດຟີດເລີຍ."

#: modules/spu/rss.c:137
msgid "Feed images"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບຟີດ"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:138
msgid "Display feed images if available."
msgstr "ສະແດງຮູບພາບຟີດຖ້າມີ."

#: modules/spu/rss.c:145
msgid ""
"Opacity (inverse of transparency) of overlay text. 0 = transparent, 255 = "
"totally opaque."
msgstr "ຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຊ້ອນ. 0 = ໂປ່ງໃສ, 255 = ທຶບແສງທັງໝົດ."

#: modules/spu/rss.c:158
msgid "Text position"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:160
msgid ""
"You can enforce the text position on the video (0=center, 1=left, 2=right, "
"4=top, 8=bottom; you can also use combinations of these values, eg 6 = top-"
"right)."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດບັງຄັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມເທິງວິດີໂອ (0=ກາງ, 1=ຊ້າຍ, 2=ຂວາ, 4=ເທິງ, 8=ລຸ່ມ; ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າປະສົມໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ 6 = ເທິງ-ຂວາ)."

#: modules/spu/rss.c:164
msgid "Title display mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດການສະແດງຫົວຂໍ້"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:165
msgid ""
"Title display mode. Default is 0 (hidden) if the feed has an image and feed "
"images are enabled, 1 otherwise."
msgstr "ໂໝດການສະແດງຫົວຂໍ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0 (ຊ່ອນ) ຖ້າຟີດມີຮູບພາບ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ຮູບພາບຟີດ, ນອກນັ້ນແມ່ນ 1."

#: modules/spu/rss.c:167
msgid "Display a RSS or ATOM Feed on your video"
msgstr "ສະແດງຟີດ RSS ຫຼື ATOM ເທິງວິດີໂອຂອງທ່ານ"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:182
msgid "Don't show"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສະແດງ"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:182
msgid "Always visible"
msgstr "ສະແດງຕະຫຼອດເວລາ"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:182
msgid "Scroll with feed"
msgstr "ເລື່ອນໄປພ້ອມກັບຟີດ"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:191
msgid "RSS / Atom"
msgstr "RSS / Atom"

#: modules/spu/rss.c:225
msgid "RSS and Atom feed display"
msgstr "ການສະແດງຟີດ RSS ແລະ Atom"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:45
msgid "Change subtitle delay"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນການໜ່ວງເວລາຄຳບັນຍາຍ"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:47
msgid "Delay calculation mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຄິດໄລ່ການໜ່ວງເວລາ"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:49
msgid ""
"Absolute delay - add absolute delay to each subtitle. Relative to source "
"delay - multiply subtitle delay. Relative to source content - determine "
"subtitle delay from its content (text)."
msgstr "ໜ່ວງເວລາສຳບູນ - ເພີ່ມການໜ່ວງເວລາໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະຄຳບັນຍາຍ. ທຽບກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ - ຄູນການໜ່ວງເວລາ. ທຽບກັບເນື້ອໃນ - ກຳນົດການໜ່ວງເວລາຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:53
msgid "Calculation factor"
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນການຄິດໄລ່"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:54
msgid ""
"Calculation factor. In Absolute delay mode the factor represents seconds."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນການຄິດໄລ່. ໃນໂໝດໜ່ວງເວລາສຳບູນ ຕົວຄູນຈະແທນເປັນວິນາທີ."

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:57
msgid "Maximum overlapping subtitles"
msgstr "ຄຳບັນຍາຍທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນໄດ້ສູງສຸດ"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:58
msgid "Maximum number of subtitles allowed at the same time."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳບັນຍາຍສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະແດງພ້ອມກັນ."

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:60
msgid "Minimum alpha value"
msgstr "ຄ່າອັລຟາຕ່ຳສຸດ"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:62
msgid ""
"Alpha value of the earliest subtitle, where 0 is fully transparent and 255 "
"is fully opaque."
msgstr "ຄ່າອັລຟາຂອງຄຳບັນຍາຍທຳອິດ, 0 ແມ່ນໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດ ແລະ 255 ແມ່ນທຶບແສງທັງໝົດ."

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:64
msgid "Interval between two disappearances"
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງການຫາຍໄປສອງຄັ້ງ"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:66
msgid ""
"Minimum time (in milliseconds) that subtitle should stay after its "
"predecessor has disappeared (subtitle delay will be extended to meet this "
"requirement)."
msgstr "ເວລາຕ່ຳສຸດ (ເປັນ ms) ທີ່ຄຳບັນຍາຍຄວນສະແດງຫຼັງຈາກອັນກ່ອນໜ້າຫາຍໄປ."

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:69
msgid "Interval between disappearance and appearance"
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງການຫາຍໄປ ແລະ ການປະກົດຂຶ້ນ"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:71
msgid ""
"Minimum time (in milliseconds) between subtitle disappearance and newer "
"subtitle appearance (earlier subtitle delay will be extended to fill the "
"gap)."
msgstr "ເວລາຕ່ຳສຸດ (ເປັນ ms) ລະຫວ່າງຄຳບັນຍາຍຫາຍໄປ ແລະ ອັນໃໝ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:74
msgid "Interval between appearance and disappearance"
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງການປະກົດຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ການຫາຍໄປ"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:76
msgid ""
"Minimum time (in milliseconds) that subtitle should stay after newer "
"subtitle has appeared (earlier subtitle delay will be shortened to avoid the "
"overlap)."
msgstr "ເວລາຕ່ຳສຸດ (ເປັນ ms) ທີ່ຄຳບັນຍາຍຄວນສະແດງຫຼັງຈາກອັນໃໝ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:80
msgid "Absolute delay"
msgstr "ໜ່ວງເວລາສຳບູນ"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:80
msgid "Relative to source delay"
msgstr "ທຽບກັບການໜ່ວງເວລາແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:81
msgid "Relative to source content"
msgstr "ທຽບກັບເນື້ອໃນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:274
msgid "Subsdelay"
msgstr "ໜ່ວງເວລາຄຳບັນຍາຍ"

#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:291
msgid "Overlap fix"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການຊ້ອນກັນ"

#: modules/stream_extractor/archive.c:54
msgid "libarchive based stream directory"
msgstr "ໄດເລັກທໍຣີສະຕຣີມທີ່ອີງໃສ່ libarchive"

#: modules/stream_extractor/archive.c:58
msgid "libarchive based stream extractor"
msgstr "ຕົວສະກັດສະຕຣີມທີ່ອີງໃສ່ libarchive"

#: modules/stream_filter/adf.c:42
msgid "ADF stream filter"
msgstr "ຟິວເຕີສະຕຣີມ ADF"

#: modules/stream_filter/aribcam.c:45
msgid "ARIB STD-B25 Cam module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ Cam ARIB STD-B25"

#: modules/stream_filter/cache_block.c:498
msgid "Block stream cache"
msgstr "ແຄຊສະຕຣີມແບບບລັອກ"

#: modules/stream_filter/cache_read.c:569
msgid "Byte stream cache"
msgstr "ແຄຊສະຕຣີມແບບໄບຕ໌"

#: modules/stream_filter/decomp.c:62
msgid "LZMA decompression"
msgstr "ການຄາຍການບີບອັດ LZMA"

#: modules/stream_filter/decomp.c:66
msgid "Burrows-Wheeler decompression"
msgstr "ການຄາຍການບີບອັດ Burrows-Wheeler"

#: modules/stream_filter/decomp.c:71
msgid "gzip decompression"
msgstr "ການຄາຍການບີບອັດ gzip"

#: modules/stream_filter/hds/hds.c:208
msgid "HTTP Dynamic Streaming"
msgstr "ການສະຕຣີມແບບໄດນາມິກຜ່ານ HTTP"

#: modules/stream_filter/inflate.c:201
msgid "Zlib decompression filter"
msgstr "ຟິວເຕີຄາຍການບີບອັດ Zlib"

#: modules/stream_filter/prefetch.c:529
msgid "Stream prefetch filter"
msgstr "ຟິວເຕີດຶງຂໍ້ມູນສະຕຣີມລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#: modules/stream_filter/prefetch.c:532
msgid "Buffer size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດບັບເຟີ"

#: modules/stream_filter/prefetch.c:533
msgid "Prefetch buffer size (KiB)"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດບັບເຟີດຶງຂໍ້ມູນລ່ວງໜ້າ (KiB)"

#: modules/stream_filter/prefetch.c:535
msgid "Read size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດການອ່ານ"

#: modules/stream_filter/prefetch.c:536
msgid "Prefetch background read size (bytes)"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດການອ່ານເບື້ອງຫຼັງລ່ວງໜ້າ (ໄບຕ໌)"

#: modules/stream_filter/prefetch.c:538
msgid "Seek threshold"
msgstr "ເກນການຄົ້ນຫາ"

#: modules/stream_filter/prefetch.c:539
msgid "Prefetch forward seek threshold (bytes)"
msgstr "ເກນການຄົ້ນຫາໄປໜ້າລ່ວງໜ້າ (ໄບຕ໌)"

#: modules/stream_filter/record.c:49
msgid "Internal stream record"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກສະຕຣີມພາຍໃນ"

#: modules/stream_filter/skiptags.c:235
msgid "APE/ID3 tags-skipping filter"
msgstr "ຟິວເຕີຂ້າມແທັກ APE/ID3"

#: modules/stream_out/autodel.c:46
msgid "Autodel"
msgstr "ລຶບອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: modules/stream_out/autodel.c:47
msgid "Automatically add/delete input streams"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ/ລຶບ ສະຕຣີມຂາເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:43
msgid ""
"Integer identifier for this elementary stream. This will be used to \"find\" "
"this stream later."
msgstr "ຕົວລະບຸເລກຖ້ວນສຳລັບສະຕຣີມພື້ນຖານນີ້. ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອ \"ຄົ້ນຫາ\" ສະຕຣີມນີ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:46
msgid "Destination bridge-in name"
msgstr "ຊື່ປາຍທາງ bridge-in"

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:48
msgid ""
"Name of the destination bridge-in. If you do not need more than one bridge-"
"in at a time, you can discard this option."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງ bridge-in ປາຍທາງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງ bridge-in ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ ສາມາດຂ້າມຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໄດ້."

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:52
msgid ""
"Pictures coming from the picture video outputs will be delayed according to "
"this value (in milliseconds, should be >= 100 ms). For high values, you will "
"need to raise caching values."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບທີ່ມາຈາກຂາອອກວິດີໂອຈະຖືກໜ່ວງເວລາຕາມຄ່ານີ້ (ເປັນ ms, ຄວນ >= 100 ms)."

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:56
msgid "ID Offset"
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ ID"

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:57
msgid ""
"Offset to add to the stream IDs specified in bridge_out to obtain the stream "
"IDs bridge_in will register."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມໃສ່ ID ຂອງສະຕຣີມທີ່ລະບຸໃນ bridge_out."

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:60
msgid "Name of current instance"
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ປັດຈຸບັນ"

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:62
msgid ""
"Name of this bridge-in instance. If you do not need more than one bridge-in "
"at a time, you can discard this option."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ bridge-in ນີ້."

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:65
msgid "Fallback to placeholder stream when out of data"
msgstr "ກັບໄປໃຊ້ສະຕຣີມຕົວແທນເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນໝົດ"

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:67
msgid ""
"If set to true, the bridge will discard all input elementary streams except "
"if it doesn't receive data from another bridge-in. This can be used to "
"configure a place holder stream when the real source breaks. Source and "
"placeholder streams should have the same format."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະໃຊ້ສະຕຣີມຕົວແທນເມື່ອແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັກຂາດຫາຍ. ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຕົວແທນຄວນມີຮູບແບບດຽວກັນ."

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:72
msgid "Placeholder delay"
msgstr "ການໜ່ວງເວລາຕົວແທນ"

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:74
msgid "Delay (in ms) before the placeholder kicks in."
msgstr "ເວລາໜ່ວງ (ເປັນ ms) ກ່ອນທີ່ຕົວແທນຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ."

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:76
msgid "Wait for I frame before toggling placeholder"
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າເຟຣມ I ກ່ອນຈະສະຫຼັບຕົວແທນ"

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:78
msgid ""
"If enabled, switching between the placeholder and the normal stream will "
"only occur on I frames. This will remove artifacts on stream switching at "
"the expense of a slightly longer delay, depending on the frequence of I "
"frames in the streams."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ການສະຫຼັບຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນສະເພາະໃນເຟຣມ I ເພື່ອຫຼຸດພາບແຕກ."

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:92
msgid "Bridge"
msgstr "ບຣິດ (Bridge)"

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:93
msgid "Bridge stream output"
msgstr "ຂາອອກສະຕຣີມແບບບຣິດ"

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:95
msgid "Bridge out"
msgstr "ບຣິດອອກ"

#: modules/stream_out/bridge.c:108
msgid "Bridge in"
msgstr "ບຣິດເຂົ້າ"

#: modules/stream_out/chromaprint.c:57
msgid "Duration of the fingerprinting"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາຂອງການເຮັດລາຍນິ້ວມື (fingerprinting)"

#: modules/stream_out/chromaprint.c:58
msgid "Default: 90sec"
