msgid "Session category"
msgstr "ໝວດໝູ່ເຊດຊັນ"

#: modules/stream_out/rtp.c:98
msgid ""
"This allows you to specify a category for the session, that will be "
"announced if you choose to use SAP."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໝວດໝູ່ສຳລັບເຊດຊັນທີ່ຈະປະກາດຜ່ານ SAP."

